<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Lokonda</book>
  <para style="h">Malako</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mlk</para>
  <para style="toc2">MALAKO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nsango e bɔlɔti eki Malako</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nsango e bɔlɔti nga bokomaki</para>
  <para style="mt1">Malako</para>
  <para style="imt">Ibangelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Nde Nsango i bɔlɔti inɛi, ɛnɛ eki Malako eyali eependa buube mpe ɛɛhɔ yoyala ɛɛkɔtɔmɔki la lontondo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nko nde bɛlɔngɔ bee lontondo, aolia Yesu nga «Bona ooki Ndjakomba» (1, 1). Yaa nkombe iiko eheya banto lyanya, endaka eumeyamɛ mbala buuke nde Nsango e Bɔlɔti (1, 11; 9, 7; Lenda la nde 3, 11; 5, 7), ɛɛli etikale ibomba nde mpoha eeki Yesu (Lenda 3, 12; 5, 43; 7, 24; 8, 30; 9, 30). Itina nɔ? – Itina iiki nkombe iiko yɔɔhɔ yoebetana nko kaki olenda ɔnɛ obakaki ibɔ nde ekulusu nga botepelaki bonkondi bo bahola bo Loma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ntango iiko yoola bontomwa bo e ngauko, ɛɛlɛmɛ bonto la bonto aboambe la ihiko. Lotomo looki Yowane Buuni, ɛnɛ eunaki Yesu, loyalaki yobela banto bayaɔhɔle (1, 2-8), (1, 2-8).</para>
  <para style="ip">Nkamba, Yesu ayaɛniɛ nde bihoke mbuha e eleko e bemekano anɛ eyalaki nde nko nde amɛlɛ (1, 12-13). Malako aɛnia mbala buuke bonkumu booki Yesu, la anɛ eeta nde banto baboyeele, la anɛ elaka nde banto buuke la mpe anɛ ebikya nde banto ba nkandi (1, 14-8, 30).</para>
  <para style="ip">Nde empulu ɛnɛ ekinde e epe e bonkanda bookinde, Malako aɛnia booli Yesu itwɛnɛ lyale, la yowa la yokundwa Yelusalɛmɛ (8, 31-10, 52). Abelaki bakɛndi la nde mbala ihato yaa tabatingola. Atepela mbala la mbala itina iikinde mpe ayahanga «Bona ooki Bonto», yaa ndenge eyali nde mpendja eyali ibomba imɔɔ i bɔnɛnɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aɔtwaki Yelusalɛmɛ la lokumo lo bɔnɛnɛ, aokoha baatɛkɛki byomba nde tɛmpɛlo mpe aoponana la ilanga iiki benkondi beeki Isalaɛlɛ. Eyalaki mpe itina iiki nde epoha yopa balako baa nsuki itina iiki baapobolange, la banto bankuma, la bakɛndi la nde (Bekapo. 11-13).</para>
  <para style="ip">Bekapo 14-15 betepela itina iiki biina bepe be nsuki beeki Yesu. Nde empulu isolo iiki elambo eetindeyaki nde la banto baakinde (bakapolaki nde la ibɔ mampa la vino), lɔbɔndɔ lookinde loyalaki nde kiika Ngesemani, ndenge eebobutaki ibɔ, ndenge eebokatelaki ibɔ etumbo, ndenge e bolyakaki ibɔ nde ekulusu, ndenge ebotombaki ibɔ nde baombo. Buuna bo ehato bo iwa iikinde, bainto batanɛ ipoku bomponga mpe baobata nsango mbɔ angokundwɛ (16, 1-8). Baotopuhwe nko looko. (Nkɔti iikina i kala ibombaki Nsango e Bɔlɔti ɛnɛ eki Malako ihangya empulu enkina etepela ndenge eeyaɛniaki Yesu eka banto lombuha lo yokundwa mpe ndenge eekondelaki nde nde liko. Nsango i Bɔlɔti inkina itepela mboo iiko ndenge e botale).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuha e yotanga Nsango e Bɔlɔti eeki Malako, ongoyeeba nga bohangaki bonkondi bo bahola bo Loma mbɔ Yesu e Nazalɛti «ayalaki mpendja Bona ooki Ndjakomba» (15.39)?</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Balako baaki Yowane Buuni</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3, 1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yow 1, 19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Ibangako iiki Nsango e Bɔlɔti eeki Yesu Kilito, Bona ooki Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Nko nga bɔkɔtɔki ntepeli Isaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">«Ngotinda bontomwa booki emi lontondo lookiɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">kela aɔhɔle ndjela eekiɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Lyoi iiki bonto ilika bobeki nde bokili bo bɛkɔngɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">Lɔɔhɔlɔ ndjela eeki Nkolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">lohembola beboko beekinde!»<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yowane Buuni aolaki nde bokili bo bɛkɔngɔ mpe alakaki ngɔnɛ: «Lwendja bihɛlɛlo biikinyo, luunama mpe Ndjakomba angolibola bahumu baakinyo.» <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Bokili bonkuma booki Yudeya la banto baki Yelusalɛmɛ batɛ eka nde yotya boliboli bo basumu baki ibɔ mpe abaunɛ nde ndjale e Yɔlɔdani.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yowane ambɔlɔtɔkɛ mpoho i nyama e kamela<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kamela:</char></note>, la nkamba e ekopo e nyama nde bompempe bookinde, ambɔɔlɛkɛ nko byɛndju la baita ba ndjue. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Abelɛ banto ngɔnɛ: «Ɔnɛ oye la lombuha looki emi, ampenda la nguya mpe ntyɛli la la ilɛngɛ iilitola behinga be bikote biikinde. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Emi nduuna la bahi yaa nde angoluuna la Bolimo bo Bɔyɛngwa.»<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyunama mpe ndengwa eeki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3, 13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3, 21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Nde elaka iko, Yesu aumɛ Nazalɛti ɛnɛ eki Ngalilaya mpe aunamɛ eka Yowane nde ndjale e Yɔlɔdani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Anɛ e olɛ nde nde bahi, aɛnɛ liko ilipwɛ mpe Bolimo bo bɔyɛngwa bobohulwelɛ nga embenga. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Mpe lyoi yuumɛ nde liko, itepelɛ: «Oyali Bona ooki emi openda emi yolanga, mbulwake la wɛ buuke.» <verse eid="MRK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Teengya, Bolimo botombɛ Yesu nde bokili bo bɛkɔngɔ. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Mpiko akelɛ bɛkɔlɔ ntuku inɛi mpe satana abolengolɛ. Ayalaki nde la nyama i bobe mpe bentomwa beeki Ndjakomba bamboyakɛ yobosalela.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aetɛ banto ba bahaki banɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4, 12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4, 14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Lombuha lobutaki ibɔ Yowane, Yesu atɛ Ngalilaya yolaka Nsango e Bɔlɔti eki Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Atepelɛ: «Elaka yoyela, bonkumu booki Ndjakomba bongokitɛ ntute. Lwendja bihɛlɛlo, mpe lwamba Nsango e Bɔlɔti!»<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Elaka elekaki nde bokili bo ndjale e Ngalilaya, aɛnɛ Simo la bohibotonga ookinde Andele balika bɔtɛyi nde ndjale; itina bayalaki bahaki. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Londjeele, mpe ngolokitya bahaki baaki banto.» <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />La mbala ɛmɔɔ, bahenɛ bɛtɛi beekibɔ mpe baboyelɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Anɛ eyaundjɛ nde bona o botale, aɛnɛ Yakɛ, bona ooki Zebede, la Yowane bohibotonga okinde. La ibɔ mpe bayalaki nde waato bookibɔ baɔhɔlɔ bɛtɛi. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />La mbala ɛmɔɔ, abaetɛ; mpe bahenɛ ihe eki ibɔ Zebede nde waato nde la basali, baboyelɛ.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bonto o tungyamɛ la bolimo bo bobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4, 31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yesu atɛ Kapalanaumu nde la bakɛndi la nde. Nde buuna bo sabata, Yesu aɔtwɛ nde botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ, mpe abangɛ yolaka. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Banto baabokaki bakulaki bakoto la balako baakinde; itina alakaki la bonkumu penda balaki ba bobeko. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Nde botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ buuko, bonto ɔmɔɔ ayalaki la bolimo bo bobe mpe abobɛ: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />«Lookiɛ la nso nɔ, wɛ Yesu e Nazalɛti? Ongoyɛ yotolyaka? Ndjeba ɔnwe wɛ: Bɔyɛngwa booki Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yesu aangoyɛ bolimo bo bobe mpe abope botindo: «Pilama mpe ola eka bonto ɔnɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Mpe bolimo bo bobe bopukuhɛ bonto uuko la nguya, abobɛ mpe aolɛ ekande. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Banto bankuma bakulɛ bakoto, babangɛ yoyaubola ɔmɔɔ la ɔmɔɔ: «Lɔnɛ nke? Enda ilako i ntɛmu ipayama la bonkumu bonkuma! Apa betindo la eka belimo be bobe mpe bebookela!» <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Mpe lokumo lookinde lopalangana la bituka binkuma bi Ngalilaya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abikyɛ nyango e bokilo eeki Simo</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 8:14-15">Mat 8, 14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-39">Luk 4, 38-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Elaka eha nde aola nde botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ, atɛ nde la Yakɛ la Yowane eka Ba Simo la Andele. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Nyango e bokilo eki Simo abetamaki la pɛpɛlɛ; nko Yesu aokitele aiko, babopɛ nsango e nkandi ekinde. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Yesu ayaundjɛ ntute la nde, abobutɛ nde lɔbɔ, aboemyɛ mpe abikɛ. Mpe nyango e bokilo abapɛ byomba bi ndɛlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />La ikɔlɔ, anɛ eha waane bohulwa, baboyelɛ banto bankuma bayali la nkandi mpe la banɛ bayali la belimo be bobe. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Imonga inkuma ihokamaki nde buuho bo botumba. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Abikyɛ banto buuke bayalaki la nkandi botindo la botindo mpe apandjɛ la belimo be bobe buuke. Talanga belimo be bobe betepele, itina baboebaki.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aumɛ Kapalanaumu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat 4, 23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4, 42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />La nkɛhɛ e elonge, ayaolyɛ, atɛ nde ekele, mpiko, abangɛ yɔbɔndɛlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simo la baayalaki la nde babangɛ yobotila. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Mpe elaka eha ibɔ babɔɛnɛ, babobelɛ: «Banto bankuma bakotila.» <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Tuume anɛ totu looko lonkina, nde bihe binɛ biyali ntute la anɛ, itina ndake la mpiko, uuko wambɔ itina iiyaki emi.» <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Mpe atɛ yolaka nde betumba be lɔbɔndɔ beeki Ngalilaya enkuma, mpe apandjɛ belimo be bobe.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abikyɛ bonto oyali la behale</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5, 12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Bonto ɔmɔɔ oyali la behale ayɛ eyali Yesu, akɔɔ bakulubɔngɔ ntondo eekinde mpe abɔbɔndɛlɛ mbɔ: «Kaki olanga, ɔɔhɔ yɔmpɛtɔlɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Yesu abookɛ ihɛi; ahembolɛ lɔbɔ, abobutɛ mpe abobelɛ: «Ndanga, pɛtwa!» <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Nko nde elaka iko behale behilɛ, mpe apɛtwɛ. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Yesu abounoyɛ nko nde elaka iko, mpe abokokomyɛ nde ambɔ <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />«Tohangelake la bonto ɔmɔɔ. Kɛndɛ tooyaenie eka Nkanga eeki Ndjakomba mpe paaya ikapo itina iiki mpɛtwa eekiɛ elenge ɛɛkɔtɔki Mose, engoyala eka ibɔ itatoli.» <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Yaa bonto uuko, anɛ ɛkɛndɛ nde, atɛ yopalanganiaka Nsango ɛkɔ mpe eyɛ ywebetana, nko aiko Yesu taunwa yɔtwa nde bihe nde baiho ba banto. Ayoyabombe nde bikele, mpe baayaki eka nde baumaki ndjoko inkuma.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu abikyɛ loondo lɔmɔɔ lo ɛhɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 9:18">Mat 9, 18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5, 17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Mbuha e biina, Yesu aunwɛ Kapalanaumu, banto baokɛ nsango mbɔ ayali nde botumba. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Bayɛ buuke yohokama, mpe la ntondo e buuho botumba ndye e yoemala teyala. Yesu abalakɛ Nsango e Bɔlɔti. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Nko aiko, banto baboyelɛ bonto ɔmɔɔ o ɛhɛlɛ onga banto banɛi babilɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Nga boyalaki lyale yokita eyali nde, itina i banto buuke, bakondelɛ nde nsamba, batondolɛ itundu mpe bahuloyɛ ɛhɛlɛ ndye eyalaki Yesu, la lokala lokinde. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Yesu aɛnɛ waambi booki ibɔ, abelɛ ɛhɛlɛ: «Bona oki emi, basumu baakiɛ bangolibwɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Bamɔɔ balaki ba bobeko baayalaki aiko, bakihɛ mpe babangɛ yoyabela nde betema: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />«Itina iitepela bonto ɔnɛ ngɔnɛ nɔ? Atoola Ndjakomba. Ɔnɛ ɔɔhɔ yolibola bahumu nɔ nga teyala Ndjakomba nde amɛlɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Yesu tatɛmɛ yweba bikaneno biiyalaki la ibɔ, ababelɛ: «Itina nɔ iyali nyo la bikaneno bi lolenge luuko nde betema bekinyo? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Yobela ɛhɛlɛ: “Basumu bakiɛ bangolibwɛ”, laa yobobela: “Langwa, kɔhɔ lokala lookiɛ mpe kɛndɛ” yomba eependa lyale nɔ? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Yaa, itina iki lwebe mbɔ Bona ooki Bonto ayali la bonkumu nde bokili bo yolibola basumu», abelɛ ɛhɛlɛ: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />«Nkobela, langwa, kɔhɔ lokala lookiɛ, inwa eka wɛ!» <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Nko aiko ɛkɔ, ayaemyɛ, abilɛ lokala lokinde mpe aolɛ ntondo eeki banto bankuma. Bautɛ byɔli, babangɛ yokumya Ndjakomba mpe bahangɛ: «Tatwɛni lɔnɛ!»<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aetɛ Lewi</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat 9, 9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5, 27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Yesu aolɛ lenkina, atɛ looko lo ndjale e bɔnɛnɛ. Boloy bonkuma boyɛ ekaande mpe abalakɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Anɛ yoleke nde, aɛnɛ Lewi, bona oki Alafe akihi nde botumba bo mputi. Abobelɛ: «Ondjele!» Aemalɛ mpe aboyelɛ. <verse eid="MRK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Nga bokihaki Yesu nde mesa yɔlɛ byomba nde botumba booki Lewi, buuke bo bataakoli ba mputi la banto bankina ba bahumu bakihaki nde mesa ɛmɔɔ ibɔ la nde mpe la bakɛndi la nde, bamboboyelakɛ bayalaki buuke. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Balaki ba bobeko baayalaki Bafalisaya, babɔɛnɛ alɛ nde la bataakoli ba mputi la banto ba bahumu, bayɛ yobela bakɛndi la nde: «Itina nɔ ilɛ nde nde la bataakoli ba mputi la banto ba bahumu?» <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Anɛ eokɛ Yesu, ayɛ yobabela: «Banto baapa la nkandi bapotilake nkanga, nko baayali la nkandi. Ntiya yweta banto ba sembo yaa ndjaki yweta banto ba bahumu.»<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buubo itina iiki yokila</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9, 14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5, 33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Bakɛndi la Yowane la Bafalisaya bambookilakɛ. Banto bayɛ yuubola Yesu: «Itina nɔ bakɛndi baki Yowane la Bafalisaya bakilake, baakiɛ bapokile?» <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Lokanena elaka eekihi baamboye ntɛkɔ e ibala ibɔ la mbali, nko baokila byomba? Elaka enkuma eyali ibɔ la mbali, bapɔɔhe yokila byomba. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Yaa elaka yoye, anɛ enga mbali aume; bangokila. <verse eid="MRK 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />La bonto ɔmɔɔ apɔɔhe yohamba ehenda e ntɛmu la e tɛkɛ; nga ngauko, etate ɛnɛ e ntɛmu engoyatola etate ɛnɛ e tɛkɛ mpe engopenda ywatwa. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />La bonto ɔmɔɔ apɔɔhe yotika baana ba bɔntɔngu nde bikutu bi kala; nga ahotika, baana baoyatola bikutu bi kala mpe la baana la bikutu byopitana; batikake baana ba ntɛmu nko nde bikutu bi ntɛmu!»<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu la buuna bo sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6, 1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Buuna bo sabata bɔmɔɔ, Yesu alekɛ nde ngonda e muma i bele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bele eyali lomuma lo enga lɔsɔ, lookelaka ibɔ mampa.</char></note>. Nde ndjela, bakɛndi la nde babangɛ yonika bele. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Bafalisaya babobelɛ: «Lenda, itina nɔ ikela bakɛndi la wɛ ipa bobeko booki nso botinde nde buuna bo sabata?» <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Talotangi laino iikelaki Dawidi, anɛ eyalaki nde la mpoha mpe la ndjala nde la baayalaki la nde? <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Anɛ yɔtwaki nde nde botumba bo Ndjakomba nde elaka eeki Nkanga e bonkondi Abiatale. Mpe aɔlɛ mampa i bakapo iilɛkɛ nko Nkanga i Ndjakomba, mpe aopa la banto baayalaki la nde?» <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Sabata ekelamaki itina iki bonto; bonto takelama itina iki sabata. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Ɛkɔiko, Bona oki Bonto ayali bonkondi booki la sabata.»<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu abikyɛ bonto ɔmɔɔ nde buuna bo sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12, 9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6, 6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Yesu aunwɛ yɔtwa nde botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ. Bonto ɔmɔɔ owɛ lɔbɔ ayalaki aiko. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Bafalisaya balendɛ Yesu kaki aɔhɔ yobobikya nde buuna bo sabata, eyalaki itina iki babate ndjela yobopunda. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Yesu ayɛ yobela bonto owɛ lɔbɔ: «Emala aiko ntondo eki banto bankuma.» <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Mpe abaubolɛ: «Bobeko botinda nɔ nde buuna bo sabata? yokela bɔlɔti laa yokela bobe? Yobikya bonto laa yobolyaka?» Tababounoya mbeko. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Yesu abalendɛ la lɔkɛlɛmɔli; aokɛ bobe ywɛnɛ ndenge epa ibɔ tabayali la ihɛi la bonto ɔnɛ oyali la nkandi, abelɛ bonto uuko: «Hembola lɔbɔ lookiɛ.» Nde mpe alohembolɛ, mpe lɔbɔ lookinde lɔbɔngɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Bafalisaya baolɛ, nko baoyole, batɛ itokela nkuko ibɔ la ekambi eeki Elode kela batile lolenge lo yobolyaka.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banto buuke bayɛ eka Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yesu ayaɔngɔlɛ nde la bakɛndi laa nde bokili bo ndjale. Etuluku e banto eumɛ Ngalilaya, Yudeya, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Yelusalɛmɛ, Idume mpe nde ibu i mboka i ndjale e Yɔlɔdani, la bihe biituti la bokili bo Tilɛ la Sido. Banto buuke bayɛ eyali Yesu itina baokɛ iikelaki nde. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Abelɛ bakɛndi la nde babotilele waato itina banto tabaobuuka mpika. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Nga bobikyaki nde banto buuke, bankuma bayali la nkandi bapuhwɛ looko looyalaki nde itina iki babɔbɛnge. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Anɛ ebɔɛnɛki belimo be bobe, beyalikɛ nde bekolo beekinde, mpe bebobɛ: «Wɛ oyali Bona oki Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Yesu akokomyɛ belimo be bobe tabaebyake ooyali nde.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ahɔlɛ bakɛndi la nde lyomu la bape</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat 10, 1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6, 12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Yesu akondelɛ nde ngomba; aetɛ banto baalangaki nde, mpe batɛ eka nde. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Ahɔlɛ etuluku e lyomu la bape, baiko abaeta bɛnkɔmwa. Akelaki ngauko itina iki bayale ibɔ la nde mpe itina iki yobatinda yoebya Nsango e Bɔlɔti <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />la nguya eki yoolya belimo be bobe. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Lenda baina baaki banto lyomu la bape bahɔlɔki nde: Simo – abobekyaki Petelo –, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Yakɛ la bohibotonga ookinde Yowane, ibɔ bayape bana baaki Zebede – Yesu abapaaki lina i Bwanɛngɛ, elimbola wambɔ «bana baaki nkake» –, <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andele, Pilipo, Batɛlɛmi, Matayo, Toma, Yakɛ, bona oki Alafe; Tade, Simo bonto o Yɛlɔtɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yɛlɔtɛ eyali ingomba iiki banɛ batila epanda eeki Isalaɛlɛ.</char></note>, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />Mpe Yudasi Isikaliɔtɛ, ɔnɛ ɔtɛkɛki Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bokundi booki Yesu balanga babotombe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Yesu atɛ nde botumba. Banto buuke bayɛ yohokama, tɛyɔbɔngɔ nde la bakɛndi la nde bale la byomba. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Anɛ eokɛ botonga bookinde iileka, bayɛ yɔbɔkɔhɔ batu laa nde, itina bahangaki: «Angounguhanɛ!»<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ababutolɛ mbeko nde ikambo imɔɔ ibopundaki ibɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mat 12, 22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11, 14-23</ref>. <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12, 10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Balaki ba bobeko baumaki Yelusalɛmɛ, batepelɛ: «Ayali la nguya eki Bezebule<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Belezebule eyali imɔɔ lina iki satana wambɔ bonkondi booki belimo be bobe</char></note>!» mpe bahangɛ lenkina: «Aolya belimo be bobe nde nguya eeki bonkondi bo belimo be bobe.» <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Yesu abaetɛ mpe abapɛ ndjɛlya inɛ: «Ndenge nɔ Satana aɔhɔ yopandja Satana? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Nga bonkumu bɔmɔɔ booyakapola bɔkɔ kiika, bonkumu buuko tabongwemala lenkina; <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Mpe nga bokundi bɔmɔɔ booyakapola bɔkɔ amongo, bokundi buuko tabongwemala lenkina. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Nga Satana aoyamunia nde amɛlɛ mpe aoyakapola, tangoyunwa ywemala, yoohila itina ikinde. <verse eid="MRK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />Bonto ɔmɔɔ apɔɔhe yɔtwa nde botumba booki bonto o nguya mpe yɔkɔhɔ byomba bikinde binkuma, nko boondola laino behinga; nkamba aopundja binkuma biyali nde botumba. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Ndohangela nhɔhɔlɔ, basumu bankuma baaki banto bangolibwa la bitooli binkuma binga ibɔ batoole Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Yaa bonto onkuma ongotoola Bolimo bo bɔyɛngwa, ihumu iiko taingolibwa, ingoyala botako la botako.» <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yesu atepelaki ngauko itina babobelaki: «Ayali la bolimo bo bobe.»<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyango la bahibotonga baaki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12, 46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8, 19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Nko aiko, nyango la bahibotonga ba beele baaki Yesu bayɛ; baemalɛ nde bongala, batindɛ bonto aboete. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Banto buuke babolingaki mpe babobelɛ: «Lenda, nyango la bahibotonga baakiɛ bayali nde bongala bakotila.» <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Ooyali nyango ekimi nɔ mpe baayali bahibotonga baakimi baanɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Nkamba alendɛ baakihaki ntute la nde mpe ahangɛ: «Lenda nyango la bahibotonga baaki emi ibɔ banɛ. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Nyango eekimi mpe bahibotonga baakimi eyali banɛ bakela iilanga Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Lwɛlya looki booni</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mat 13, 1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8, 4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yesu aunwɛ lenkina yolaka banto nde bokili bo ndjale e bɔnɛnɛ. Boloy bonkuma boyɛ yohokama ntute la nde, akondelɛ nde waato mpe akihɛ. Boloy bonkuma boyalaki nde bokili bo ndjale e bɔnɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Abalakɛ mbo buuke nde ndjɛlya, mpe nde ilako iki nde ababelɛ: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />«Lolangola! Bɔmɔɔ buuna, booni bɔmɔɔ atɛ itoona byomba nde ngonda eekinde. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Aiko yoyone nde, ɛmɔɔ ndambo e byopo bɛkɔɔ nde bokili bo ndjela: mpulu bayɛ mpe batɔnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Byopo benkina bɛkɔ nde ndye e babɔkɔ epa la babu buuke; byɔbɛlɛ byolɛ lobango itina babu tabayala. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Elaka ebalelɛ bɛkɔ waane, benyitelɛ mpe byomɛ itina belubo tabetela. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Byopo benkina bɛkɔ nde nsɛndɛ. Nsɛndɛ yolwɛ mpe ibatikɛ mpika, mpe tabeunwa yolia muma. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Yaa byopo benkina bɛkɔ nde babu ba bɔlɔti; byolwɛ, bebotɛ, muma yolwɛ mpe itundɛ, mpe bɔɔbɛlɛ bɔmɔɔ bobotɛ muma ntuku ihato, bɔɔmɔ ntuku botoba, mpe bonkina muma bonkama.» <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Ooyali la batoi ba yooka aoke!»<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Itina iilaka Yesu nde ndjɛlya</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 13:10-15">Mat 13, 10-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8, 9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Anɛ etikalɛ ibɔ nko ibɔ bamɛlɛ, bɛnkɔmwa lyomu la bepe la baayalaki aiko babuubolɛ itina iiki ndjɛlya. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Ababelɛ: «Nyo, balopɛ babomba baaki bonkumu booki Ndjakomba; yaa banɛ bankina baokake nko nde ndjɛlya, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />kela</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">“nkya balenda tabaɛnɛke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">nkya baoka tabatingolake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">oolongi tabaoyendja bihɛlɛlo biikibɔ, mpe bahumu baakibɔ tabaolibwa!”»<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alimbolɛ lwɛlya looki booni</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mat 13, 18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8, 11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Aiko epa nyo lotingole lwɛlya lɔnɛ, longotingola ndjɛlya inɛ imɔɔ inkuma ngamo? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Booni aona Lyoi iiki Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Banto bamɔɔ bayali nga bokili bo ndjela aiko yonama Lyoi iiki Ndjakomba: anɛ eha ibɔ balioka, nko aiko Satana ayoye mpe aopapola lyoi iko yonamaki eka ibɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Banto banɛ bamɔɔ, lolenge nko lɔkɔ, baoyamba boopo nde babu ba babɔkɔ: nko baoyoke Lyoi iki Ndjakomba, baumeyake ikɔ la ibulwako. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Yaa tabayali la belubo, baumeyake lyoi iiki Ndjakomba nko elaka ɛmɔɔ. Mpe nga batungya la bekakatano behoya itina iki Lyoi iki Ndjakomba, bapɔtɛmɛke yotona waambi booki ibɔ. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Banto bankina babatake boopo nde nsɛndɛ; eyali banɛ baoka Lyoi iiki Ndjakomba, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />yaa bayali la mpoha i bokili, bolengoli bo bɔmɛngɔ mpe mpoha yobata inkuma ibaɔtwɛlɛ, inyatɛ Lyoi iki Ndjakomba mpe ipobote muma. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Banto bankina babatake boopo nde babu ba bɔlɔti: baiko baokake Lyoi iiki Ndjakomba, baambake ikɔ mpe babotake muma, bamɔɔ ntuku ihato, bamɔɔ ntuku botoba, mpe bamɔɔ bonkama.»<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwɛlya looki moinda</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8, 16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Bayelake moinda kela batike nde nse e ehaka, laa nde nse e bobanga? Epoyali yɔlɛlya nde ikondi? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Itina nkola la yomba ɛmɔɔ ebombi engoyala nko ola nde boponga, nkola la ɛmɔɔ iihi engoyala nko ebetana mpe nko ola nde bongala. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Nga bonto ayali la batoi ba yoka aoke!» <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Ababelɛ lenkina: «Lobataka nkɛpɔ la inɛ yooka nyo! Botindo boomekela wɛ banto, bangokomekela la wɛ nko ngauko mpe ɛmɔɔ mbala engopenda. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Itina bonto okati bangoobopa lenkina; opa tokati bangɔɔbɔpɔmɔlɔ la yoomba iiko eyali la nde.»<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lwɛlya looki boopo bɔnɛ boolwa bɔkɔ amongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yesu ahangɛ lenkina: «Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba wɛɛli nga booni aolike boopo nde babu. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />La alale la aɛtɛtɛle, la waane la botio, boopo booyole mpe booyolwe nde apwebe. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Babu bayolia bakɔ bamɛlɛ ntondo bɔɔbɛlɛ nkamba mpongo, mpe nde nsuki mpongo eyolɛ la muma. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Mpe anɛ eha lomoma lwɛlɛ, baɔkɔhɔ lokula itina i yopupola, aiko wambɔ eleko e ninika yookita.» <verse eid="MRK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Ababelɛ lenkina: «Yomba ɛnɛ yɔɔhɔ nho yɛɛlya la Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba nɔ? Lwɛlya nnɔ lɔɔhɔ nso yoopa? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Eyali nko nga lomoma lo nsɛmbɛ e lobambo; anɛ yonaka ibɔ nde babu, loyali lomoma looleka bɔkɛ nde byopo benkuma beyali nde bokili. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Anɛ eha baona, loolɛ mpe loolwɛ penda bete benkuma, loolyɛ bitape bi bɔnɛnɛ ko la mpulu i liko yɔɔhɔ yotonga baimbu baakibɔ aiko.»<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yesu alakaki Lyoi iiki Ndjakomba nde ndjɛlya buuke ye ngauko; nde lolenge lɔɔhɔki ibɔ yotingola. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Tabalaka nko ɔtɛya lwɛlya; yaa nga aotikala nde la bakɛndi laa nde, amboobalimboyake inkuma.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ataamelɛ eeleele</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat 8, 23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8, 22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Nko nde buuna buuko la ikɔlɔ, Yesu abelɛ bakɛndi la nde: «Topendye ndjale.» <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Anɛ eha bahena banto, bakɛndi la Yesu babotombɛ nde waato booyalaki nde; byato benkina mpe beyalaki aiko. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Eeleele ekelɛ mpe buula bolikɛ bahi nde waato, ntute eeki waato boyole la bahi. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Endaka Yesu nde alalaki nde mbaka, bɔtɛ nde bokili. Bakɛndi laa nde baboemolɛ, mpe babohangelɛ la nguya: «Bolaki, toowa: epokokele la lobo lɔmɔɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yesu aemwɛ, ataamelɛ eeleele mpe abeelɛ ndjale: «Pilama! yala nyɛ!» Eeleele ehilɛ mpe bolenge bɔkɔtɛ. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Mpe ayɛ yobela bakɛndi laa nde: «Itina imba nyo looke bɔɔmɔ nɔ? Taloyali laino la waambi?» <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Bakɛndi laa nde bayalaki la bɔɔmɔ bɔmɔɔ bo bɔnɛnɛ mpe bayaubolɛ ibɔ la ibɔ: «Bonto ɔnɛ ae nɔ, la eeleele la ndjale ibookela?»<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu abikyɛ bonto ɔmɔɔ oyalaki la belimo be bobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat 8, 28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8, 26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Bakitɛ looko lɔnɛ lɔmɔɔ lo ndjale nde bokili booki ba Ngelaza. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Nko Yesu aohulwe nde waato, bonto ɔmɔɔ oyalaki la bolimo bo bobe oumaki nde ngelo ayɛ yoponana la nde. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Bonto uuko ambookihake nko nde ngelo, mpe la bonto ɔmɔɔ taɔhɔ yuunwa lenkina yobotungya mpanga. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Mbala buuke imba babotungyakɛ mpanga la mpeko, ambootamolakɛ mpanga mpe amboopupolakɛ mpeko. Nko bonto oyalaki la nguya yobobuta. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Ambooyalakɛ bilaka binkuma la waane la botio nko nde ngelo la ngomba, yoboba mpe yoyaotalya la babɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Anɛ e ɛnɛki nde Yesu botale, apuhuwɛ yɔkɔ bakulubɔngɔ ntondo eeki nde, <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />mpe abobɛ la nguya: «Yesu Bona ooki Ndjakomba ɛnɛ e lobola, lookiɛ la emi nɔ? Nkɔbɔndɛlɛ nde lina iki Ndjakomba, tontungyake!» <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />– Atepelaki ngauko itina Yesu abobelaki: «Bolimo bo bobe, ola eka bonto ɔnɛ!» – <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Yesu abuubolɛ: «Lina ikiɛ nɔ?» Aunoyɛ: «Lina ikimi “Botonga”, itina toyali buuke.» <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Bolimo bo bobe bɔbɔndɛlɛ Yesu la weembeli mbɔ tabatindake looko lonkina.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Mpeni looko lo ngomba, eyalaki la botonga bo bɔnɛnɛ bo ngulu bayaki yɔlɛkɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Belimo be bobe bɛbɔndɛlɛ Yesu mbɔ: «Ototinde nde ngulu, tɔɔtwe nde ikɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yesu abapɛ ndjela mpe belimo be bobe beolɛ, byɔtwɛ nde ngulu, mpe botonga boyabilingolɛ nde nkitibɔngɔ, boyaunɛ mpe bowɛ nde ndjale. Ngulu iyalaki ntute la nkoto ipe. <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Baahɛndjɛlɛki ngulu balotɛ, mpe batɛ itopa nsango nde imonga mpe nde bahala. Banto bayɛ yolenda iilekaki. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Bayɛ ntute la Yesu, mpe baɛnɛ bonto o belimo be bobe akihi, angɔlɔtɛ bɔlɔti, mpe angohilamɛ nkya boyalaki nde la belimo be bobe buuke. Banto bankuma baokɛ bɔɔmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Banɛ baɛnɛki ndenge inkuma, babangɛ yobahangela ilekaki itina iiki bonto o belimo be bobe la ngulu. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Babɔndɛlɛ Yesu aume nde ehe ekibɔ. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Anɛ ekondelɛ Yesu nde waato, bonto ooyalaki la belimo be bobe abɔndɛlɛ Yesu abɔkɔhe bakɛnde. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Yesu talanga, yaa abobelɛ: «Unwa eka wɛ, mpe nde bokundi bookiɛ, lɔndɔyɔ ibɔ inkuma inga Nkolo akokelelɛ la ihɛi inga nde akookelɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Bonto uuko atɛ mpe alɔndɔlɛ nde lobandja lo bamonga lyomu bakambo bankuma babokelelaki Yesu, mpe ibɔ bankuma bautɛ byɔli.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bona o buunto ooki Yailo la buunto oobutaki ehenda eeki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat 9, 18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8, 40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yesu aunwɛ yopendya lenkina nse e mboka e ndjale nde waato, mpe banto buuke bayaki yoyahokia ntute la nde, ayalaki nde ibongo. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Bonkondi bɔmɔɔ boki botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ bo lina Yailo ayɛ. Anɛ e ɛnɛ nde Yesu, ayalikɛ nde bekolo bekinde <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />mpe abɔbɔndɛlɛ la weembeli nde ante: «Bona okimi o buunto o eboha awa la nkandi, yaka mpe oboapye bɛbɔ kela abate lobiko mpe nkandi ehile!» <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Batɛ nde la Yesu ndjela ɛmɔɔ. Banto buuke batɛ itoboyelaka mpe itoboukaka mpika la lombuha.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Nde banto baiko, eyalaki la buunto ɔmɔɔ ɔkɔnɛ nkandi yotanga bakila, akelɛ la ɛkɔ mbula lyomu la ipe. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Anyɔkwɛ eka benganga buuke, aheyɛ lokutu lokinde lonkuma mpe tabika; yaa nkandi engalaki nko ngaangala. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Anɛ eokɛ nde nsango eeki Yesu, ayɛ la lombuha lo banto, mpe abutɛ ehenda eeki Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Itina ayahangelaki: «Kaki ngɔbɛngɛ nkya bihenda biikinde, nkoobika.» <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />La mbala ɛmɔɔ, bakila baatangaki batenɛ, mpe aokɛ nde byonge biikinde angobikɛ la nkandi eyalaki laa nde. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Nko aiko, Yesu aokaki nguya ɛmɔɔ engoboolɛ nde byonge, akalimwɛ mpe alendɛ boloy, ahangɛ: «Omboombute nde bihenda nɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Bakɛndi la nde babobelɛ: «Wɛnɛ banto buuke baokuke mpika ndjoko inkuma mpe oyuubola lenkina: “Ombombute nɔ?”» <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Yaa Yesu alendɛ ntute la nde kela aɛnɛ ɔnɛ omboobobute. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Buunto ɔkɔ atutumaki la bɔɔmɔ itina aebaki inɛ ingobolekelɛ; ayɛ yɔkɔ bakulubɔngɔ nde bekolo beeki Yesu mpe abohangelɛ nhɔhɔlɔ enkuma . <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Yesu nde ɔnɛ obobelɛ: «Bona okimi o buunto, waambi bookiɛ bongokobikyɛ, kɛndɛ bɔlɔti mpe bika la nkandi ekiɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Nko aiko etepela Yesu, banto bankina baumɛ nde botumba booki bonkondi bo botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ, bayɛ yobobela: «Bona okiɛ o buunto angowɛ. Itina iitungya wɛ lenkina bolaki nɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Ankya bookaki Yesu ngauko, abelaki Yailo: «Tookake bɔɔmɔ, yala nko la waambi.» <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Yesu taunwa yolanga bonto aboyele, akɔhɛ nko Petelo, Yakɛ la Yowane bohibotonga oki Yakɛ. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Bakitɛ nde botumba booki bonkondi bo botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ, Yesu aɛnɛ banto bata baunwa, balela mpe bayahaba la yoboba la nguya. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Aɔtwɛ mpe ababelɛ:«Lolyaleka mpe lolela ngauko itina nɔ? bona tawei, alali.» <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Mpe banto babɔɔlɛ. Aolyɛ banto bankuma, akɔhɛ nko ihe la nyango eki bona la banɛ bayaki la nde, baɔtwɛ mpiko eyalaki bona. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Yesu abutɛ bona nde lɔbɔ mpe abobelɛ: «Talita kumi» – Elimbola wambɔ: «Eboha e buunto, nkobela, emala!».<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Nko aiko, bona eboha e buunto aemalɛ mpe abangɛ yɔkɛndɛ – ayalaki la mbula lyomu la ipe. Mbala ɛmɔɔ, banto bankuma bautɛ byɔli. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Yesu abakokomyɛ tabahangelake la bonto ɔmɔɔ, nkamba aobabela: «Lobopa yomba ale.»<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Banto ba Nazalɛti tabaumeya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mat 13, 53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4, 16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yesu aumɛ aiko, mpe atɛ eka ibɔ. Bakɛndi la nde baboyelɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Anɛ ekitɛ buuna bo sabata, alakɛ nde botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ. Banto baabokaki bakulɛ nko bakoto. Bahangɛ: «Aobata inɛ nko? Ɔnɛ ndenge e waanya bobopayemɛ nɔ, mpe mpapo ye ngɔnɛ ikelama nde bɛbɔ beekinde? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Epa nde sapate, bona oki Balia, bohibotonga oki Yakɛ la Yose la Yuda la Simo? Mpe nkana ikinde tatoyali nso la ibɔ anɛ?» Ɛkɔiko ekelaki tababoumeyake. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Ntepeli babototyake ndye inkuma imola nko eka ibɔ, nde bokundi bookinde, la nde ikundi iikinde.» <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Mpiko taɔhɔ yokela la mpapo ɛmɔɔ, nko ndambo e banto ekɔnɔki bayɛ eka nde, abapyɛ bɛbɔ mpe baobika. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Yesu akamwɛ la bobya waambi bookibɔ.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Lotomo looki Bakɛndi lyomu la bape</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mat 10, 5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9, 1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">La lombuha luuko, Yesu atɛ bihe biiko bi ntute itina iki yolaka. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Aetɛ bakɛndi la nde lyomu la bape mpe abatindɛ bape bape. Abapɛ bonkumu nde belimo be bobe <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />mpe abakokomyɛ ngɔnɛ: «Talɔkɔhɔke la yomba ɛmɔɔ itina iki lɔkɛndɔ, imola nko bontuma; mampa nkola, mbango nkola, bɔhɔlɔ nde ipɔtɔ iikinyo nkola. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Lɔlɔtɔkɔ bikote, yaa talotombake bakakya bape.»<verse eid="MRK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Ababelɛ lenkina: «Kaki longokitɛ ndye ɛmɔɔ, lokihaka nde botumba bonga balwambɛ tii nko elaka enga luume aiko. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Mpe nga eyali la ehe ɛmɔɔ epatelanga elwambe la mpe telanga elooke, loolaka nde ehe iiko mpe lopupolaka buutu booki bekolo beekinyo. Engoyala lolambo itina iiko ibɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Bakɛndi la nde batɛ yoebyaka la banto bankuma mbɔ baendje bihɛlɛlo. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Baolyaki belimo be bobe buuke, mpe baɔlɔki banto buuke ba nkandi bohuku mpe babikaki.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iwa iiki Yowane Buuni</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat 14, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9, 7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Nkumu Elode aokɛ batepela itina iki Yesu, itina lina iikinde yebetanaki epululu. Bamɔɔ bahangaki: «Yowane Buuni angokundwɛ! Ɛkɔiko eyali nde la nguya yokela mpapo.» <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Yaa bamɔɔ batepela: «Eyali Elia.» Mpe bankina bahanga: «Eyali ntepeli ɛmɔɔ nde inɛ i kala.» <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Anɛ yookɛ Elode mbo iiko inkuma, ayahangelɛ: «Ɔɔkɔ Yowane! ɛnɛ epupolaki emi bɔtɛ, yaa aokundwa!»<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Wambɔ Elode nde kiika atindaki babute Yowane, babotungye mpanga mpe babɔtɛye bɔlɔkɔ. Eyalaki itina angolaki Elodiade, waali ɔnɛ we bohibotonga okinde Pilipo. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Yowane abelaki Elode: «Epoyali bɔlɔti ɔkɔhe waali ooki bohibotonga okiɛ la ibala!» <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Elodiade aunaki Yowane mpe alangaki abolyake, yaa taɔhɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Elode amboyokakɛ Yowane bɔɔmɔ, aboebaki ayali bonto o sembo mpe o bɔyɛngwa; ambobobatelakɛ. Lombuha lo yobooka, apunwe yoeba ndenge yokela; yaa bombolangakɛ nde abooke. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Nko aiko ɛkɔ, buuna bo mbo lohuo bokitɛ, nde buuna bo mbotwa eki Elode, aetɛ banto ba bɔnɛnɛ nde ntɛkɔ, benkondi be bahola la baome ba bihe baaki Ngalilaya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Bona ooki Elodiade o buunto aɔtwɛ mpe aembɛ nsambo; Elode la baayaki nde ntɛkɔ balangaki ndenge eembaki nde. Nkumu abelɛ eboha iiko e buunto: «Ondjotye yomba enkuma elanga wɛ, mpe nkookopa ɛkɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Mpe aotia etio ɛnɛ: «Yomba enkuma eka wɛ ondjotya, nkookopa, eyale la empulu e bokopo bookimi.» <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Anɛ eolɛ eboha e buunto uuko nde bongala, aubolɛ nyango: «Ndjotye yomba nɔ?» Nyango abobelɛ: «Otya bɔtɛ booki Yowane Buuni.» <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Eboha e buunto apuhwɛ, aunwɛ eka nkumu mpe abohangelɛ mpoha ekinde: «Ndanga ompa nko aiko ekeeko bɔtɛ booki Yowane Buuni nde saani!» <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Nkumu aokɛ ihɛi; yaa tangɔɔhɔ lenkina yotona itina i etio eetiaki nde ntondo eeki baayaki nde ntɛkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Nko aiko, nkumu atindɛ ihola imɔɔ nde banɛ babɔhɛndjɛlɛkɛ, abopɛ botindo ayele bɔtɛ booki Yowane Buuni. Ihola iiko atɛ nde bɔlɔkɔ mpe apupolɛ bɔtɛ booki Yowane. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Ihola iiko ayelɛ bɔtɛ buuko nde saani mpe apɛ eboha iko e buunto, mpe nde apɛ nyango eekinde. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Anɛ eebɛ bakɛndi la Yowane lobo lɔkɔ, bayɛ yɔkɔhɔ ebembe ekinde mpe batɛ itokunda.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alehyɛ banto nkoto itano</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14, 13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9, 10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yow 6, 1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Bɛnkɔmwa bahokamɛ ntute la Yesu mpe babohangelɛ inkuma yoyume ibɔ yokela mpe yolaka. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Nga boyalaki banto buuke bata baunwa mpe tababata la ngonga yɔɔlɛ, Yesu abelɛ bakɛndi la nde: «Loyaka toyaɔngɔle nde ekele kela luutye bona o eema.» <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Bakondelɛ nde waato, batɛ nko ibɔ bamongo nde ekele. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Banto buuke babaɛnɛ booli ibɔ mpe baebɛ looko lɔnɛ looli ibɔ. Banto bapuhwɛ lobango nko nde bekolo ima nde bihe biiko binkuma mpe bakitɛ ndye iiko ntondo eeki ibɔ.<verse eid="MRK 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Anɛ ehulyɛ Yesu nde waato, aɛnɛ banto buuke; abaokelɛ ihɛi itina bayalaki nga botonga bo mpata bopokati bɔhɛndjɛli. Mpe abangɛ yobalaka bakambo buuke. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Nga bohilaki buuna, bakɛndi la Yesu bayaundjɛ ntute la nde mpe babobelɛ: «Anɛ toyali nde ekele mpe buuna bohuula. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Unoya banto banɛ batu nde bahala la nde bihe biiyali ntute la anɛ kela bahombe byomba bi ndɛɛlɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Nyo bamɛlɛ lobapaa bi ndɛɛlɛ!» Yaa ibɔ babuubolɛ: «Nko toohomba benkuka be nkɛhi nkama ipe mpe tobapa bale?» <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Loyali la benkuka benga? taloolende.» Batɛ itolenda mpe babobelɛ: «Toyali nko la benkuka betano la nsi ipe.» <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Yesu abatindɛ bakihye bonto onkuma bihoke bihoke nde baɔmbi. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Banto bakihɛ nde bihoke bi bonkama la bi ntuku itano. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Yesu akɔhɛ benkuka betano la nsi ipe, auleyɛ baiho nde liko mpe atotyɛ Ndjakomba. Abɔmbɔlɛ benkuka mpe apɛ bakɛndi la nde bakapele banto. Bakapɛ mpe nsi ipe la banto bankuma. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Banto bankuma balɛ mpe bakindɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Bakɛndi la Yesu baambolɛ bitate bi benkuka la bimpulu bi nsi biitikalaki, bayoyɛ nhandi lyomu la ipe. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Baalɛki benkuka bɛkɔ bayalaki banto nkoto itano.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akɛndɛ nde liko i bahi</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14, 22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yow 6, 15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />La mbala ɛmɔɔ, Yesu atindɛ bakɛndi la nde bakondele nde waato mpe batu ntondo eekinde, looko lo imonga i Besaida, elaka iiko nde amɛlɛ aunoya boloy. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Anɛ eha nde aunoya banto, aulelɛ nde ngomba yɔbɔndɛlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Anɛ elingɛ ikɔlɔ, waato bokitɛ nde ngina e ndjale mpe Yesu atikalɛ nde amɛlɛ nde bokonda. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Aɛnɛ bakɛndi la nde bapuuhe lenkina yoluka itina bɔmpɛmpɛ bobaunoyaki; aiko elanga nkɛhɛ ɛkie, Yesu atɛ eyali ibɔ itɔkɛndɛkɛ nde liko i bahi mpe alangaki abalekane. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Anɛ ɛbɔɛnɛ ibɔ aɔkɛnde nde liko i bahi, baokamba elima mpe baoboba. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Itina ibɔ bankuma babɔɛnɛki, mpe baokaki bɔɔmɔ. La mbala ɛmɔɔ, Yesu ababelɛ: «Lokahwa! Eyali emi; talookake bɔɔmɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Akondelɛ nde waato booyalaki ibɔ, mpe bɔmpɛmpɛ bohilɛ. Bakulɛ nko bakoto, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />itina tababuteya itina i mpapo eeki benkuka: lyanya iiki ibɔ tayɔhɔ yotingola iiko ikelamaki.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abikyɛ banto ba nkandi Ngenezalɛti</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mat 14, 34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />La lombuha loyopendya ndjale, bayɛ nde ehe eki Ngenezalɛti mpe bahulwɛ aiko. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Nko baohulwe nde waato, banto baebɛ Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Banto batɛ lobango nde etuka enkuma mpe bayelɛ banto ba nkandi nde betombo, ndye inkuma yokaki ibɔ Yesu ayali. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Ndye enkuma yɔtwaki Yesu, eyale nde bamonga eyale nde bihe la nde bahala, banto bambooyelakɛ banto ba nkandi nde biponanelo, mpe bambɔbɔndɛlɛkɛ Yesu abahene babɛnge nkya lolemba lo ehenda eekinde; mpe bonto onkuma obutaki Yesu abikaki.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu la balako baaki ba nkaa</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mat 15, 1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Buuna bɔmɔɔ, Bafalisaya la balaki ba bobeko bankina baumɛ Yelusalɛmɛ, bayɛ eka Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Baɛnɛ bamɔɔ bakɛndi la nde balɛ bakata mbindo, elimbola wambɔ nkoho ola bakata. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Ɛkɔiko, Bafalisaya la Bayuda bankuma bapɔlɛke kaki tabakoli bakata bɔlɔti, lolenge lwɛli la bɔnkɔkɔ booki ibɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Mpe nga bahuuma nde bihoke, balɛke nko nga bahoyapɛtɔlɔ. Bayali la bɔnkɔkɔ booki ibɔ bokelaka ibɔ bo enga yokola mbongo, mpoke la saani i banyandja.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Bafalisaya la balaki ba bobeko babuubolɛ: «Itina ipa bakɛndi la wɛ bakele itinda bɔnkɔkɔ nɔ? Yaa balɛke bakata mbindo!» <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Banto ba bilongi bipe, Isaya aebaki yotepela itina iikinyo, anɛ ɛkɔtɔki nde:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“Banto banɛ bandangake nko nde mbɛbu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">betema beeki ibɔ beyali botale la emi.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Bankumyake nko loliko loliko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">itina balako baalaka ibɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">bayali nko bebeko beeki banto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa 29, 13</char></note>.”<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Lotonake bebeko beeki Ndjakomba mpe loyapake la bɔnkɔkɔ booki banto.»<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yesu ababelɛ lenkina: «Lweba bɔlɔti yotona bebeko beeki Ndjakomba itina iiki lobombake bɔnkɔkɔ bookinyo! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Itina Mose atepelaki: “Omangaka ihe la nyango eekiɛ”, mpe ahangaki lenkina “Ootola laa ihe laa nyango eekinde aɛli la etumbo e iwa.” <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Yaa nyo lolakake, kaki bonto ɔmɔɔ aobela ihe ekinde laa mpe nyango ekinde: “Yomba eepa emi ndjookopa eyali Nkoloba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nkoloba iima nde bonya bo Alamɛ. </char></note> wambɔ ibondo iingobombelɛ emi Ndjakomba” –, <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />tangookambola nyango la ihe ekinde. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Ndenge iiko ekela nyo ngauko, luumola iikana Lyoi iki Ndjakomba nde ndjela eeki bɔnkɔkɔ bookinyo boolaka nyo. Mpe lwela mbo inkina i buuke ikelaka nyo ngauko.»<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Byomba biikityaka bonto mbindo</para>
  <para style="r">( lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mat 15, 10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Yesu aetɛ lenkina buuke bo banto mpe ababelɛ: «Londjalye nyo bankuma, mpe lwebaka ngɔnɛ: <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Nkola la yomba ɛmɔɔ euma nde bongala ɛɔtwa nde bonto ko yobopita. Yaa inɛ yoola nde bonto bibokityake mbindo.[ <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Ooyali la batoi ba yooka, aoke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bɔlɔngɔ bɔnɛ bopoyali nde buku inkina i kala. </char></note>!]»<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Anɛ ehenɛ Yesu boloy, aɔtwɛ nde botumba, bakɛndi la nde babuubolɛ ndimbo eeki lwɛlya luuko. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Ababelɛ: «La nyo mpe lopokati lyanya? Lɔpɔɔhe yeeba mbɔ inɛ yɔtwaka nde byonge biiki bonto ipobopitake, <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />itina ipotake nde botema yaa nko nde ikundi, nkamba iyooli nde ibela?» Aebyɛ aiko mbɔ byomba binkuma biyali pɛtɔ la yɔlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Mpe aunwɛ yotepela: «Inɛ yola eka bonto ibopitake. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Yaa nkani i bobe yumake nde ntei, nde betema beeki banto, bɔkɛlwa, iiba, yolyaka, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />iye, mpoha e bɔhɔlɔ, botema bobe, boyanga, ipuka, inkunya, bitooli, ipolo la lokilo. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Mbo iiko inkuma i bobe yumake nde ntei eeki bonto mpe ibopitake.»<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buunto ɔmɔɔ o bopakano aambelɛ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mat 15, 21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yesu aumɛ aiko, atɛ Tilɛ. Aɔtwɛ nde botumba bɔmɔɔ mpe talanga la bonto ɔmɔɔ aebe mbɔ ayali aiko, yaa taɔhɔ yuhama. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Nko aiko, buunto ɔmɔɔ ayalaki la bona ookinde o buunto otungyamaki la bolimo bo bobe. Anɛ yokɛ nde batepela itina iiki Yesu; ayɛ ntute la nde mpe ayakɔyɛ nde bekolo beekinde. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Buunto ɔkɔ ayalaki bopakano, bohi Fenisi e Sili. Abɔndɛlɛ Yesu aolye bolimo bo bobe eka bona ookinde o buunto. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Yaa, Yesu abobelɛ: «Hena laino bana bale bakinde; itina epoyali bɔlɔti yɔkɔhɔ ihɔɔ iiki bana olikele baaha ba mbwa.» <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Buunto uuko abounoyelɛ: «Nkolo, eyali nko ngauko, yaa baaha ba mbwa balɛke mpuha iiko ikɔyɔkɔ bana nde nse e mesa.» <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Yesu abobelɛ: «Itina iki mbuto eekiɛ, inwa eka wɛ: bolimo bo bobe boongolɛ eka bona ookiɛ o buunto.» <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Aunwɛ ekande mpe atanɛ bona alali nde ntange: bolimo bo bobe bongoolɛ.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abikyɛ bonto ɔmɔɔ o luumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Yesu aumɛ Tilɛ mpe alekɛ lo Sido, yota looko lo ndjale e Ngalilaya, apendyɛ lobandja lo Dekapoli. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Baboyelɛ bonto ɔmɔɔ o luumi, babɔbɔndɛlɛ aboapye lɔbɔ. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yesu abɔkɔhɛ, abotombɛ bona o botale la banto mpe abɔɔtɛyɛ behai nde batoi, atwɛ nhɔi nde bohai ko aobobuti nde lolemu. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Yesu auleyɛ baiho nde liko, ayoomɛ mpe abobelɛ: «Efata!» – Nga ambɔ «Lipwa!» – <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Nko nde elaka iko, batoi bakinde balipwɛ, lolemu lokinde lolitwɛ mpe atepelɛ bɔlɔti. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yesu abakokomyɛ tabahangelake la bonto ɔmɔɔ; yaa nkya ngauko ebahukaki nde, ibɔ batɛ nko yopalanganiaka nsango. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Banto baulɛ nkimo mpe batepelɛ: «Inkuma ikela nde iyali bɔlɔti! Aokya la bikinda mpe atepeya la bibubu!»<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu alehyɛ banto nkoto inɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mat 15, 32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Nko nde biina biiko, banto buuke bahokamɛ lenkina, nga bopa ibɔ tabayala la yomba yɔlɛ, Yesu aetɛ bakɛndi la nde mpe ababelɛ: <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />«Ndjoka banto banɛ ihɛi, bookela biina behato bayali la emi ndye ɛmɔɔ, mpe bapala yomba yɔlɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Nga nhobaunoya eka ibɔ la ndjala, bangoholwa byonge nde ndjela; itina bamɔɔ bakibɔ baumaki botale.» <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Bakɛndi la nde babuunoyelɛ: «Nde ekele ngɔnɛ, tɔɔhɔ yobata benkuka nko kela bale mpe bakinde?» <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yesu abaubolɛ: «Loyali benkuka benga?» Babobelɛ: «Toyali benkuka nsambo.» <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Nko aiko, abelɛ boloy booyalaki aiko bakihe nde babu. Akɔhɛ benkuka bɛkɔ nsambo, akumyɛ Ndjakomba, abɔmbɔlɛ mpe apɛ bakɛndi la nde kela bakapele banto bankuma. Bakɛndi la nde bakelɛ nko ngauko. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Bayalaki mpe la nsi i nkɛnkɛ. Mbuha eeki yɔtɔmɛyɛ nsi ikɔ bokako, Yesu abelɛ bakɛndi la nde baunwe yobakapela. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Balɛ mpe bakindɛ. Bakɛndi la nde baambolɛ nhandi nsambo iyoli la bimpulu biitikalaki. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Banto bayalaki ntute la nkoto inɛi. Nko aiko, Yesu abaunoyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />La mbala ɛmɔɔ Yesu akondelɛ nde la bakɛndi la nde nde waato yota lobandja lo Dalimanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bafalisaya baotyɛ elembetelo e mpapo</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mat 16, 1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Bafalisaya bayɛ mpe bayautamyɛ lɔmpɛnyɛ ibɔ la Yesu; mpe itina iiki babɔlɛbɛle ilonga, babuubolɛ aɛnie elembetelo e mpapo ɛnɛ euma nde liko. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yesu akyɛtɛnɛ nde botema mpe ahangɛ: «Itina nɔ yootya elelo ɛnɛ elembetelo? Ndohangela nhɔhɔlɔ: nkola la elembetelo ɛmɔɔ engobapayema!» <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Mpe Yesu abahenɛ, akondelɛ lenkina nde waato mpe atɛ looko lɔnɛ lɔmɔɔ lo ndjale.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bote bo mampa booki Bafalisaya la Elode</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mat 16, 5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Bakɛndi la nde babopelɛ yɔkɔhɔ mampa, bayalaki nde waato nko la mampa ɛmɔɔ.<verse eid="MRK 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yesu abakokomyɛ ngɔnɛ: «Lwepwaka! Loyalaka la nkɛpɔ la bote mampa booki Bafalisaya la booki Elode.» <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Bakɛndi la nde bayaubolɛ ibɔ la ibɔ itina tabayala la mampa. <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Yesu aebɛ nkani iikibɔ, abaubolɛ: «Loyaubola lopokati mampa itina nɔ? Talobati laino lyanya? Lopotingole? Uuko betema boolo ngauko nɔ? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Loyali la baiho, lɔpwɛne? Loyali la batoi, lopooke? Lopobopwe: <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />anɛ ɛbɔmbɔlɔki emi benkuka betano itina iki banto nkoto itano, bimpulu biitikalaki biyalaki nhandi inga?» – Bahangɛ: «Biyalaki lyomu la ipe.» <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Yesu abaubolɛ: «Mpe anɛ ɛbɔmbɔlɔki emi benkuka nsambo itina iki banto nkoto inɛi, bimpulu byambolaki nyo biyalaki nhandi inga?» – Bahangɛ: «Twambolaki nhandi nsambo.» <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Mpe nyo lopotingole laino?»<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abikyɛ bonto obolyɛ baiho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Bakitɛ Besaida; mpiko bayelɛ Yesu bonto ɔmɔɔ obolyɛ baiho mpe babɔndɛlɛ Yesu abobute. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yesu akɔhɛ bonto uuko ɔpwɛnɛke nde lɔbɔ mpe aboumolɛ nde ehe mpe abotombɛ ndye enkina. Mpiko abohingɛ nhɔi nde baiho, aboapyɛ bɛbɔ mpe abuubolɛ: «Wɛnɛ nɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Bonto uuko alendɛ mpe ahangɛ: «Nyɛnɛ banto, mbaɛnɛ nga bete bɛkɛndɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Yesu aboapyɛ lenkina bɛbɔ nde baiho; bonto uuko ahihimyɛ: abikɛ, abangɛ ywɛnɛ bɔlɔti. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Yesu abounoyɛ ekande, abobelɛ: «Twɛlyake yɔtwa nde ehe.»<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo aebyɛ mbɔ Yesu ayali Masiya</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mat 16, 13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9, 18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Yesu la bakɛndi la nde batɛ nde bihe biiko bi ntute la Sezale e Pilipi. Nde ndjela, aubolɛ bakɛndi la nde: «Banto bahangake emi ndjali nɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Babounoyelɛ: «Baamɔɔ bahangake wɛ Yowane Buuni, bankina oyali Elia, bankina mpe bahanga wɛ oyali ɔmɔɔ oki ntepeli.» – <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Abaubolɛ: «Yaa nyo, lohangake emi ndjali nɔ?» Petelo abounoyelɛ: «Oyali Masiya.» <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Yesu abakokomyɛ tabahangelake la bonto ɔmɔɔ lobo luuko.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aebyɛ iwa la <char style="w">nkundwa</char> eekinde</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mat 16, 21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9, 22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Yesu apɛ bakɛndi la nde ilako: «Ɛɛli Bona ooki bonto aɛne lyale epululu; bingambi la Nkanga i benkondi la balaki ba bobeko babotone, mpe mbuha e bɛkɔlɔ behato, akundwe.» <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Ambobabelakɛ mbo iiko potya. Petelo aboetɛ nde bokili, aɔbɔpɔndɔlɔ. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Yaa Yesu aɛbwɛ, alendɛ bakɛndi la nde mpe apɛlɛ Petelo mpendja, nde ambɔ: «Ima ntute la emi! Satana, itina nkani iikyɛ ipoyali iiki Ndjakomba, iyali iiki banto.»<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Nkamba Yesu aetɛ banto bankuma la bakɛndi la nde mpe ababelɛ ibɔ bankuma: «Bonto olanga aye mbuha ekimi, ayatonaka nde kiika, abilaka ekulusu ekinde biina benkuma mpe andjelaka. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Itina ongolanga abikye lobiko lookinde, angolobungya, yaa ongolobungya itina ikimi mpe la Nsango e bɔlɔti angobikya lɔkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Intomba yɔɔhɔ bonto yobata nɔ nga aɔkɔhɔ bokili bonkuma, mpe abungya lobiko lookinde? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Yomba ɛnɛ yɔɔhɔ bonto yopa kela ahombe lobiko lookinde nɔ? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Bonto ondjoka la emi la baoyi bakimi nsɔni nde baiho baaki ekeke ɛnɛ epomange Ndjakomba mpe e bahumu, Bona ooki Bonto angoobooka la nde nsɔni anɛ enga nde aunwe la nkɛmbɔ eeki Ihe ekinde nde la bentomwa be bɔyɛngwa.»<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yesu ababelɛ lenkina: «Ndobela nhɔhɔlɔ: bamɔɔ banto bayali anɛ tabangowa ntondo eki baɛne Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba bongoyɛ la nguya.»<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu angɛngɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mat 17, 1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9, 28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Lombuha lo biina botoba, Yesu akɔhɛ Petelo, Yakɛ la Yowane, abatombɛ nde liko i ngomba, mpiko bayalaki nko ibɔ kiika. Angɛngɛ ntondo eeki ibɔ; <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />bihenda biikinde bingɛngɛ, bikitaki mpɛmbɛ epululu; nkola la bonto ɔmɔɔ nde bokili ɔɔhɔ yɛɛlwa ngauko. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />La mbala ɛmɔɔ, baɛnɛ Elia la Mose babaolelɛ mpe bakɔtɔ byamba ibɔ la Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Petelo abelɛ Yesu: «Bolaki, eyali bɔlɔti tokihe anɛ, totonge benganda behato, bɔmɔɔ itina iikiɛ, bɔmɔɔ itina iiki Mose mpe bɔmɔɔ itina iiki Elia.» <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Petelo tatingola iiko itepala nde, itina la nde la baataki la nde bayalaki la bɔɔmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Itute ibalipɛ mpe lyoi yoolɛ nde itute iikɔ, itepelɛ: «Ɔnɛ ayali Bona ooki emi openda emi yolanga, lobookaaka!» <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Nko aiko, bakɛndi la nde balendɛ ntutentute la aiko eyalaki ibɔ, tabaunwa ywɛnɛ lenkina bonto; batiki nko ibɔ la Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Anɛ yohulwe ibɔ nde ngomba, Yesu abakokomyɛ tabahangelake la bonto ɔmɔɔ ikambo iiko imba ibɔ baɛne, tii enga Bona ooki Bonto akundwe nde baawɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Baokɛ iko ibakokomyaki nde, yaa bayaubolɛ ibɔ amɛlɛ: «Yokundwa nde nde baawɛ elimbola nɔ?»<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Mpe bakɛndi la nde babuubolɛ: «Itina nɔ itepelaka balaki ba bobeko mbɔ ɛɛli Elia aye lontondo?» <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yesu abaunoyelɛ: «Elia aɛli aya la lontondo kela alongye mbo. Yaa itina nɔ Nkɔti itepela mbɔ Bona ooki Bonto angɔyɛnɛ lyale mpe bangobotiola? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Nga la emi, ndobela: Elia ahilɛ yoya, mpe babokelaki iilangaki ibɔ, botindo boebya Nkɔti itina iikinde.»<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abikyɛ bona otungyamaki la bolimo bo bobe</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mat 17, 14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9, 37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Anɛ ikitɛ ibɔ ntute la bakɛndi banɛ bamɔɔ, baɛnɛ banto buuke bangobalingɛ mpe bayautamya lɔmpɛnyɛ ibɔ la balaki ba bobeko. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Nko banto baɔyɛne Yesu, bakulɛ bakoto mpe bayɛ lobango yobobekola. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yesu aubolɛ bakɛndi la nde: «Loowa nyo lɔmpɛnyɛ nyo la ibɔ nɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Bonto ɔmɔɔ nde banto baayalaki aiko abobelɛ: «Bolaki, ngokoyelɛ bona ookimi o loondo, atungyama la bolimo bo bobe bobokityake luumi. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Ndye inkuma iya bɔkɔ yobobuta, bobobokake nde babu, bona aolyake mpulo mpe akiɛtɛke baino, byonge biikinde byoketa. Mboobele bakɛndi la wɛ baolye bolimo buuko, yaa tabauha.» <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Nyo elelo epa la waambi! Tii elaka nɔ eenga emi nkihe la nyo? Ngoluukela botema tii elaka nɔ? Londjele bona ɔkɔ anɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Baboyelɛ bona. Nko bolimo bo bobe bɔɔyɛne Yesu, bopukuhɛ bona la nguya; ayahombɛ nde babu, ayabilingolɛ mpe aolɛ mpulo nde bonya. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yesu aubolɛ ihe eeki bona: «Mbo inɛ ibokelɛ mbula inga?» Mpe ihe abobelɛ: «Ima boboha bookinde. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Mpe mbala la mbala, bolimo bo bobe bobobokake nde ntyɛ laa mpe nde bahi itina iki bobolyake. Yaa kaki ɔɔhɔ yobobikya, yaka otokambole, otookele ihɛi!» <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yesu abobelɛ: «Itina iitepela wɛ kaki ɔɔhɔ nɔ! Yaa, inkuma yɔɔhɔ yokelama eka bonto oyali la waambi.» <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Nko aiko, ihe eki bona abobɛ: «Nyumeya! onkambole nde bobya waambi!»<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Anɛ e ɛnɛ Yesu banto baoye buuke, aangwelɛ bolimo bo bobe mpe abobelɛ: «Wɛ bolimo bɔnɛ bokitya bonto luumi mpe ekinda, nkopa botindo: ola eka bona ɔnɛ mpe tunwake yoya lenkina ekande!» <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Bolimo bobe bobobɛ, bopukuhɛ bona la nguya, mpe boolɛ. Bona akitɛ lohi angowɛ, banto buuke bayalaki aiko bahangɛ: «Angowɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Yaa Yesu abobutɛ nde lɔbɔ, abouleyɛ mpe bona aemalɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Anɛ e ɔtwɛ Yesu nde botumba, ayalaki nko nde la bakɛndi la nde, babuubolɛ: «Itina ipa nso tatɔɔhɔ yoolya bolimo buuko nɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Botindo bo bolimo buuko bɔɔhɔ yoola nko la lɔbɔndɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aebyɛ iwa la<char style="w">nkundwa</char> ekinde mbala e epe</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat 17, 22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luk 9, 43b-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Anɛ eumɛ ibɔ aiko, bapendyɛ Ngalilaya. Yesu talanga banto baebe. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Itina alakaki bakɛndi la nde: «Bona ooki Bonto angokapema nde bɛbɔ beeki banto, bangobolyaka; mpe nde buuna bo behato angokundwa.» <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Yaa bakɛndi la nde tabatingola ndimbo eeki iiko itepelaki nde mpe baokaki bɔɔmɔ yoboubola.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oopenda bɔnɛnɛ nɔ?</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat 18, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9, 46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Bakitɛ Kapalanaumu. Anɛ e ɔtwɛ nde nde botumba, Yesu aubolɛ bakɛndi la nde: «Luuko lɔɔbɛkɛtɛne nyo nde ndjela nɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Yaa ibɔ bapilamɛ, itina nde ndjela, bayaki yɔbɛkɛtɛnɛkɛ ibɔ la ibɔ itina iki baebe oopenda bɔnɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Yesu akihɛ, aetɛ bakɛndi lyomu la bape mpe ababelɛ: «Nga bonto ɔmɔɔ alanga ayale bonto o lontondo, ayalaka lombuha looki banto bankuma mpe bosali booki banto bankuma.» <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Mpe Yesu akɔhɛ bona o nkɛkɛ, aboemyɛ aiko eyalaki ibɔ; abobutɛ nde bɛbɔ, ababelɛ: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />«Bonto onkuma ongoyamba bona o nkɛkɛ nga ɔnɛ nde lina iiki emi, angondjambɛ emi kiika; mpe bonto oongondjambɛ, apondjambe nko emi, aamba la bonto oontindaki.»<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bonto opoyali la bobe la nso ayali ookinso.</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9, 49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yowane abelɛ Yesu: «Bolaki, twɛnɛki bonto ɔmɔɔ aolya belimo be bobe nde lina iikiɛ, mpe tolangaki tobohuke, itina tɔpɔkɛnde nso la nde.» <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Yaa Yesu aunoyɛ: «Talobohukake, teyali la bonto ɔnɛ o ɔhɔ yokela mpapo nde lina ikimi mpe ayunwa yotepela mbo i bobe itina iiki emi. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Itina bonto opototone, ayali looko lɔmɔɔ la nso. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Mpe bonto onkuma ongolopa ikɔpɔ i bahi ba mɛɛmɛlɛ itina loyali banto baki Kilito, ndobela nhɔhɔlɔ: tangobungya boputo bookinde.»<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu akokomyɛ bakɛndi la nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mat 18, 6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17, 1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />«Yaa kaki bonto ɔmɔɔ angɔkɔyɛ ɔmɔɔ oki biboha binɛ biyali la waambi la emi nde isumu, ɛɛli babotungye ibɔkɔ i bɔnɛnɛ nde nkingo mpe baboboke nde ndjale e bɔnɛnɛ. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Nga lɔbɔ lookiɛ lokotindake nde ndjela e bobe, pupola lɔkɔ; bɔlɔti ɔɔtwe nde lobiko lo botako lɔbɔ empulu nde ndye eeki otu nde ipoku i ntyɛ inɛ ipolimake la bɛbɔ bepe.[ <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Mpiko, “bekiho bepowake mpe ntyɛ ipolimake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bɔlɔngɔ bɔnɛ bopoyali nde benkanda benkina be kala.</char></note>”.] <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Kaki lokolo lookiɛ lokotindake nde ndjela e bobe, pupola lɔkɔ; bɔlɔti ɔtwe lokolo lɔmɔɔ nde lobiko lo botako la yoyala bekolo bape mpe otu nde ipoku i ntyɛ inɛ ipolimake[ <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Mpiko, “bekiho bepowake mpe ntyɛ ipolimake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bɔlɔngɔ bɔnɛ bopoyali nde benkanda benkina be kala.</char></note>”.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Mpe nga liho ikiɛ ikotindake nde ndjela e bobe, imola ikɔ; bɔlɔti ɔtwe nde Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba la liho imɔɔ la yoyala la baiho bape mpe otu nde ipoku i ntyɛ inɛ ipolimake. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Mpiko, “bekiho bepowake mpe ntyɛ ipolimake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9, 48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɛlia la Isa 66, 24.</char></note>”. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Itina bonto la bonto angoleka nde ntyɛ kela abate ngɔmbɔ nga bokwa.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />«Bokwa boyali yomba e bɔlɔti; yaa nga bokwa bohohila ngɔmbɔ, ɔhɔ yuunoya ngɔmbɔ ɛkɔ ngamo? Loyala la bokwa nde ntei eekinyo bamongo mpe lokiha bɔlɔti nyo la baninga.»<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Balako baaki Yesu itina iiki yolyaka ibala</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mat 19, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16, 18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yesu aumɛ aiko mpe atɛ nde lobandja lo Yudeya, penda ndjale e Yɔlɔdani. Banto buuke bahokamɛ lenkina ntute la nde mpe abangɛ yobalaka nga bokelaka nde mbala la mbala. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Bafalisaya bayɛ ntute la nde, mpe itina iiki babɔlɛbɛle ilonga, babuubolɛ: «Bebeko beekinso bepa loondo ndjela atone waali ookinde?» <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yesu abaunoyelɛ: «Mose alopaki bobeko nɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Babobelɛ: «Mose apaki loondo ndjela akɔte bonkanda bo yokapwa mpe yotona waali ookinde.» <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Mose alɔkɔtɛlɛki bobeko buuko itina i bɛtɛ boolo beekinyo. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Yaa nde ibangako, anɛ e Ndjakomba akelake binkuma, “abakelaki loondo la buunto<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10, 6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iba 1, 27; 5, 2.</char></note>”; <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />“Ɛkɔiko, loondo angohena ihe la nyango eekinde itina iiki ayale ndye ɛmɔɔ nde la waali ookinde, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />mpe ibɔ bayape bangokita nko bonto ɔmɔɔ.” Ɛkɔiko, bapooyali banto bape, yaa nko bonto ɔmɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Bonto takapolake yomba eehanganiɛ Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="MRK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Anɛ eunwɛ ibɔ nde botumba, bakɛndi baubolɛ Yesu lenkina buubo itina iiki ikambo iiko. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Kaki loondo angotonɛ waali ookinde mpe aobala onkina, eyali iyee eka waali ɔnɛ o lontondo; <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />nko nga, buunto aotona boome mpe aobala loondo lonkina, eyali iyee.»<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alɛlɛlɛ bana ba nkɛkɛ bokako</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat 19, 13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18, 15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Banto bayɛ la bana ba nkɛkɛ itina iiki Yesu abapye bɛbɔ, yaa bakɛndi la nde baunoyɛ banɛ bayaki la bana. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Anɛ eha Yesu aɛnɛ ngauko, aokɛ bobe mpe abelɛ bakɛndi la nde: «Lohenya bana baye eka emi! Talobahukake, itina Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba boyali itina iki banɛ bayali nga ibɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Ndobela nte nhɔhɔlɔ: bonto oopwambe Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba nga bona o nkɛkɛ tangɔtwa nde bɔkɔ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Mpe akɔhɛ bana baiko; abapyɛ bɛbɔ mpe abatɔmɛlɛ bahɔi.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihɛi iiki bokulaka</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat 19, 16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18, 18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Aiko eta Yesu akɛnde, bonto ɔmɔɔ ayɛ lobango, ayalikɛ ntondo ekinde mpe abobelɛ: «Bolaki bo bɔlɔti, nkele ngamo kela mbate lobiko lo botako?» <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yesu abobelɛ: «Itina indjeta wɛ bonto o bɔlɔti nnɔ? Bonto o bɔlɔti tayali, ɔnɛ o bɔlɔti nko Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Weba bebeko: “Tolyakake bonto; tolangake waali laa boome ooki bonto; tuubake; totepelake mbo i boyanga itina iiki bonto; tɔkɔhɔke yomba eki bonto la boyanga; manga ihe la nyango eekiɛ.”» <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Bonto uuko abounoyelɛ: «Bolaki, Ima boboha, nkelake mbo iiko inkuma.» <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yesu abolendɛ la lolango, mpe abobelɛ: «Okutwa nko yoomba ɛmɔɔ: kɛndɛ, ɔtɛke byomba binkuma biyali la wɛ, kapela bɛmbɔlɔ, mpe ongobata bɔmɛngɔ nde liko; la lombuha luuko, wɛ yaka mpe ondjeele.» <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Yaa anɛ e okɛ bonto uuko iko iha babobela, aholwɛ byonge, atɛ la ihɛi itina ayalaki la lokutu buuke.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yesu alendɛ banto banɛ babolingaki mpe ababelɛ bakɛndi la nde: «Eyali lyale bekulaka baɔtwe nde Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Bakɛndi la nde bakimɛ mpendja la iiko itepelaki nde. Yaa Yesu ababelɛ lenkina: «Bana baaki emi, eyali lyale yɔtwa nde Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Ndjɔu aɔhɔ yɔtwa nde itundu i sinani, yaa eyali lyale bokulaka aɔtwe nde Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Bakɛndi la nde bakulɛ nko bakoto, mpe bayaubolɛ ibɔ bamongo: «Yaa aiko bonto oongobika nnɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yesu abalendɛ mpe ababelɛ: «Eka banto tɛngɔɔhɔ yokelama, yaa epa eka Ndjakomba, itina inkuma yɔɔhɔ yokelama eka Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Petelo abobelɛ: «Alya, nso tohenɛ inkuma, tokoyelɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yesu abounoyelɛ: «Ndobela nte nhɔhɔlɔ: kaki bonto angohenɛ itina iiki emi mpe Nsango e Bɔlɔti, botumba bookinde, bahibotonga baakinde, nkana i bainto iikinde, nyango eekinde, ihe eekinde, bana baakinde, ngonda iikinde, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />angobata penda mbala nkama aiko ekeke: betumba, bahibotonga, nkana i bainto, nyango, bana mpe ngonda, la bɛnyɔkɔ; mpe nde bokili bɔnɛ bongoya, angobata lobiko lo botako. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Yaa, banto buuke bayali aiko ekeeko la lontondo, bangoyala banto ba nhuki, mpe banɛ bayali banto ba nhuki, bangoyala banto ba lontondo.»<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aebyɛ mbala e ehato iwa la <char style="w">nkundwa</char> ekinde</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat 20, 17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18, 31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Balangwɛ yota Yelusalɛmɛ. Yesu aɔkɛnde ntondo eeki bakɛndi la nde, bayalaki la lɔkɛi mpe banɛ babayelaki bayalaki la bɔɔmɔ. Yesu akɔhɛ lenkina bakɛndi la nde lyomu la bape mpe abahangelɛ nde inɛ ilanga ibokitele. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Ababelɛ: «Lwalya, Aiko wambɔ toyoli Yelusalɛmɛ, mpiko enga Bona ooki Bonto akapeme eka Nkanga i benkondi la Balaki ba bobeko. Bangobopa etumbo e iwa mpe bangobokapa eka bapakano. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Bangɔbɔɔlɔ, bangobɔtwa nhɔi, bangobokula bebambo mpe bangobolyaka. Mpe, nde buuna bo behato, angokundwa.»<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buubo booki Yakɛ la Yowane</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mat 20, 20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Nko aiko, Yakɛ la Yowane, bana ba beele baaki Zebede, bayɛ ntute la Yesu. Babobelɛ: «Bolaki, tolanga otokelele ikambo iilanga nso tokobele.» – <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yesu abaubolɛ: «Lolanga ndokelele nɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Babounoyelɛ: «Anɛ enga wɛ okihe nde bokopo bookiɛ bo nkɛmbɔ, otopaka epoha yokiha ɔmɔɔ nde lɔbɔ lookiɛ lo loome, ɔmɔɔ nde lo lwali.» <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Lopwebe yomba ɛnɛ ekana nyo. Lɔɔhɔ yɔmɛlɛ mbongo e lyale enga emi mɛle, laa yobata nyunama e lyale ɛnɛ enga emi mbate?» <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Babounoyelɛ: «Ɔɔ tɔɔhɔ.» Yesu ababelɛ: «Bɔlɔti, lɔngɔmɛlɛ mbongo enga mɛle mpe longobata nyunama ɛnɛ ɛnga emi mbate. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Yaa ikambo iilenda yokiha nde lɔbɔ looki emi lo lwali la lo loome; epa emi ɔnɛ ɔhɔ yopa, ndye iiko iyali iki banto banɛ baɔhɔyɛlɛ Ndjakomba.»<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Anɛ e bakɛndi banɛ bamɔɔ lyomu baokake iiko, bapɔndɔlɛ Yakɛ la Yowane. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Yesu abaɛtɛ ibɔ bankuma mpe ababelɛ: «Lweba bɔlɔti mbɔ banto banɛ baangaka bihe nga nkumu batikake banto baiko bankuma nde nse eeki ibɔ, mpe banto ba bɔnɛnɛ babaokyake nguya eekibɔ. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Teyalake ngauko eka nyo. Endaka aiko eyali nyo, kaki bonto alanga ayale bɔnɛnɛ, ayalaka bosali booki nyo, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />mpe nga ɔmɔɔ okinyo alanga ayale bonto o lontondo, ayalaka ilɛngɛ iiki nyo bankuma. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Itina Bona ooki Bonto taya itina iki babosalele, yaa ayaki itina iki nde asalele banto mpe apa lobiko looki nde itina i yohombola banto buuke.»<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abikyɛ Balatime, bonto obolyɛ baiho</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat 20, 29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18, 35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Bakitɛ Yeliko. Anɛ eolɛ Yesu la bakɛndi laa nde nde imonga iiko la banto buuke, bonto ɔmɔɔ obolyɛ baiho o lina Balatime, bona o loondo ooki Time, ambookihakɛ nde bokili bo ndjela kela abondelake. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Anɛ eokɛ nde Yesu e Nazalɛti aoleke, abobɛ: «Yesu, Bona oki Dawidi, ondjokele ihɛi!» <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Banto buuke babuukɛ kela apilame, yaa nde abobɛ lenkina la nguya: «Bona ooki Dawidi, ondjokele ihɛi!» <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yesu aemalɛ mpe ahangɛ: «Lobondjetele.» Baboetɛ mpe babobelɛ: «Emala, yala la lokaho, akweta.» <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Abokɛ ehenda eekinde, alɛmwɛ mpe akitɛ ntute la Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yesu abuubolɛ: «Olanga nkele nnɔ itina ikiɛ?» Bonto uuko obolyɛ baiho abobelɛ: «Bolaki, Ndanga nyɛnɛ leenkina.» <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Mpe Yesu abobelɛ: «Kɛndɛ, waambi bookiɛ bongokobikyɛ.» Mbala ɛmɔɔ, aunwɛ yɛnɛ mpe ayelɛ Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aɔtwɛ Yelusalɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21, 1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19, 28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yow 12, 12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Anɛ ehuhamɛ ibɔ la Yelusalɛmɛ, ntutentute la Betipaze la Betani, bakitɛ nde Ngomba e Olive. Yesu atindɛ bakɛndi la nde bape ababelɛ: <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />«Lɔkɛndɛ nde ehe iiko elwɛlɛlɛ; nga lookita, lokootaana lyaha i mpunda itungi, la bonto ɔmɔɔ takondeli laino nde ɛkɔ. Lobotungolaka mpe loboyelaka. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Kaki bonto angolubolɛ: “Itina iikela nyo ngako nɔ!” Lobobelaka: “Nkolo ayali la mpoha la ɛkɔ, akootinda ɛkɔ nko la bɔkɛkɛ.”»<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Bakɛndi la nde batɛ mpe batanɛ lyaha i mpunda itungi nde bongala, ntute la buuho bo botumba. Babotungolɛ. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Banto bankina bayalaki aiko babaubolɛ: «Uuko okela nyo nɔ? Itina nɔ iitungola nyo bona o mpunda uuko?» <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Babapɛ mbuto ɛnɛ ebabelaki Yesu mpe babahenɛ batu la ɛkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Bayelɛ Yesu bona o mpunda ɛkɔ; baetandelɛ bihenda nde bɔkɔngɔ, mpe Yesu akihɛ nde liko iiki ɛkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Banto buuke batandɛ bamputa baaki ibɔ nde ndjela, bamɔɔ batikaki babundja baumaki la ibɔ nde ngonda. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Banto baayalaki lontondo la baayalaki la lombuha looki Yesu babobɛ la nguya: «Ozana! bokako boyali eka bonto ɔnɛ ooye nde lina iiki Nkolo! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Bokako boyali nde bonkumu bɔnɛ booye, bonkumu booki Nkaa eekinso Dawidi! Ozana mpiko nte nde lobola!» <verse eid="MRK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Yesu aɔtwɛ Yelusalɛmɛ mpe atɛ nde tɛmpɛlo. Anɛ eheyaki nde yolenda mbo inkuma iilekaki aiko, atɛ Betani nde la bakɛndi la nde lyomu la bape itina buuna bohilaki.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alimyɛ bote bo figi</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mat 21, 18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Buuna bɔnɛ bɔmɔɔ, elaka ɛnɛ ehenyaki ibɔ Betani, Yesu aokɛ ndjala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Aɛnɛ ima botale bote bo figi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">figi eyali lomuma lɔmɔɔ loki bote bo figi.</char></note> boyalaki la nkaha buuke, atɛ itolenda nga boyali la muma; anɛ ayaundjɛ nde ntute la bote bɔkɔ, atanɛ nko nkaha, itina teyala eleko eki muma i figi. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Yesu abelɛ bote buuko bo figi: «La bonto ɔmɔɔ tangɔɔlɛ lenkina la muma ikiɛ!» Mpe bakɛndi la nde baokaki iitepelaki nde.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nde tɛmpɛlo</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat 21, 12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19, 45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yow 2, 13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Bakitɛ Yelusalɛmɛ. Yesu aɔtwɛ nde tɛmpɛlo mpe apandjɛ baatɛkɛ la baahomba byomba nde tɛmpɛlo; abumbolɛ mesa iki baendji ba bɔhɔlɔ la bikihelo biiki batɛki ba bimenga, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />mpe tahena la bonto ɔmɔɔ ahɛkɛte la yomba ɛmɔɔ nde tɛmpɛlo. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Nkamba abalakɛ ngɔnɛ: «Nde Nkɔti, Ndjakomba ahanga: “Botumba booki emi bongobekala botumba bo lɔbɔndɔ itina iki bekundi benkuma.” Yaa nyo, lokityɛ bɔkɔ nganda eeki biiba!» <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Nkanga i benkondi la balaki ba bobeko baokɛ mbo ikɔ mpe batilɛ yolyaka Yesu; baboobokaki bɔɔmɔ, itina banto bankuma bakimaki la balako bakinde. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Anɛ ekitɛ ikɔlɔ, Yesu la bakɛndi la nde baolɛ nde imonga.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu la bote bo figi bɔnɛ boomɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mat 21, 20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />La nkɛhɛ eeki buuna bɔnɛ bɔmɔɔ, aiko yoleke ibɔ nde ndjela, baɛnɛ bote bo figi: boomɛ tii nde belubo. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Petelo abopwɛ inɛ ilekaki, abelɛ Yesu: «Bolaki, lenda bote bo figi bɔnɛ bolimyaki wɛ, bongoomɛ bonkuma.» <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yesu abelɛ bakɛndi la nde: «Loyala la waambi la Ndjakomba! <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Ndobela nhɔhɔlɔ, kaki bonto angobelɛ ngomba ɛnɛ: “Ima aiko mpe yaboka nde ndjale e bɔnɛnɛ”, mpe nga tayala la lɔmpɛnyɛ nde botema bookinde, yaa aumeya iiko itepela nde ikookelama, ingokelama. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Ɛkɔiko ndobela: Inkuma inga nyo lobondele nde lɔbɔndɔ, luumeyaka longobatɛ, mpe ingokokyama. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Mpe nga ongwemalɛ kela ɔbɔndɛle, nga oyali la lobo la bonto, sabinya nde, kela Ihe eki nyo eyali nde liko akosabinye basumu baakiɛ. [<verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Yaa kaki loposabinye baninga, ihe eki nyo ɛnɛ eyali nde liko tangosabinya basumu bakiinyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11, 26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bɔlɔngɔ bɔnɛ bopoyali nde benkanda benkina be kala. Lenda nde Mat 6, 15.</char></note>.]»<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bonkumu booki Yesu buuma nko?</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat 21, 23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20, 1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Baunwɛ lenkina Yelusalɛmɛ. Aiko eta eunwa Yesu nde tɛmpɛlo, la Nkanga i benkondi la balaki ba bobeko la bingambi bayɛ eka nde. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Boboubolɛ: «Iiko ikela wɛ, okela nde nguya eeki nɔ? Bonto ookopɛ bonkumu bo yokela ikɔ nɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Nduubola nko buubo bɔmɔɔ; kaki loombutola, emi mpe nkolohangela nga nkela mbo iiko la nguya eeki nɔ. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Nyunama eemba Yowane akelakɛ, yumaki eka Ndjakomba laa eka banto ? lonsangele.» <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Yaa ibɔ babangɛ yoyaubola ibɔ kiika: «kaki tongobobelɛ yumaki eka Ndjakomba, akoohanga: “Itina ipa nyo taloboumeya nɔ?” <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Yaa kaki tobohangela: “Yumaki eka banto, aiko…”?» – Baokaki banto bɔɔmɔ, itina banto bankuma baɛnɛki Yowane nga ntepeli mpendja. – <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Baunoyelɛ Yesu: «Nso topwebe.» – Mpe Yesu ababelɛ: «Emi mpe mpolohangele nga nkela mbo inɛ la nguya eeki nɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Lwɛlya looki basali ba bobe ba elanga e vino</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat 21, 33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20, 9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Nkamba, Yesu abalakɛ nde ndjɛlya: «Bonto ɔmɔɔ aonɛ elanga e vino; akombɛ ɛkɔ, akelɛ booko bo yoama muma i vino mpe atongɛ eliko itina iiki yɔhɛndjɛlɛ. Apɛɛ bahali ba bilanga kela baputele ɛkɔ, mpe nde kiika atɛ lɔkɛndɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Anɛ ekitaki eleko e yonika muma, atindɛ bohali bɔmɔɔ eka baputeli kela babopaa iikinde muma i vino. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Yaa baputeli baiko babutɛ bohali buuko, babokulɛ mpe babounɔyɛ bapombo botoo. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Bɔmɛlɛ elanga aunwɛ yotinda bohali bonkina; la nde mpe babokulɛ nde bɔtɛ mpe babohabolɛ. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Atindɛ bosali bonkina, la uuko, babolyakɛ; bamɔɔ buuke bakulamaki loli mpe balyakaki banɛ bankina. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Nhuki e bonto ootikalaki la bɔmɛlɛ elanga nko bona ookinde o loondo o lolango. Abotindɛ bonto o nsuki, itina ayahangelaki mbɔ: “Bakoomanga bona ookimi.” <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Yaa baputeli bayabelɛ ibɔ la ibɔ: “Lenda bonto oongotikala la lokutu! Loyaka, tobolyake, kela lokutu lokite looki nso!” <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Ngauko, babutɛ bona, babolyakɛ mpe babobokɛ nde bongala bo elanga e vino.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />«Bɔmɛlɛ elanga iiko e vino angookela nnɔ? Angooya, angoolyaka bahali baiko mpe angoopa elanga iiko e vino eka baputeli bankina. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Talotangi laino Nkɔti ɛnɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">“ikondi inɛ yee batongi ba botumba baumolake</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">ikinɛ yookita ikondi i ndombe ibuti botumba la bonkundu.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Uuko eyali waango booki Nkolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">eka nso eyali ɛɛnwa!”»<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Bakondi baaki Bayuda batilɛ ndjela yobuta Yesu, itina baebaki mbɔ atepelaki lwɛlya luuko itina iiki ibɔ. Yaa baokaki banto bɔɔmɔ; babohenɛ mpe bonto la bonto ayaunoyɛ.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mputi eeki Kaisalo</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat 22, 15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20, 20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Batindelɛ Yesu bamɔɔ Bafalisaya la banto baaki Elode babɔlɛbɛle ilonga la mbo itepela nde. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Babobelɛ: «Bolaki, tweba mbɔ wɛ otepelake nhɔhɔlɔ; mpe opolotake bonto itina opelendake bilongi biiki banto, yaa olakake ndjela iiki Ndjakomba nhɔhɔlɔ. Otohangele, bobeko booki nso botopa ndjela topute mputi eeki Kaisalo laa nkola? Tɔɔhɔ yoputa laa tatoputake?» <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Yesu aebaki boyali ibɔ bilongi bipe; ababelɛ: «Londenga itina nɔ? Londjele nkɛhi ɛmɔɔ, ndende.» <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Baboyelɛ ɛmɔɔ mpe Yesu abaubolɛ: «Elongi la lina inɛ ikɔti anɛ biyali biiki nɔ?» – Babobelɛ: «Biiki Kaisalo». <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Lopaka Kaisalo biikinde, mpe lopaka Ndjakomba biikinde.» Bakulɛ bakoto la mbuto eekinde.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buubo itina iiki nkundwa eeki baawɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat 22, 23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20, 27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Ba Saduseyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12, 18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ba Saduseyo</char></note> bankina bayɛ eka Yesu. – Ibɔ bahangake nkundwa teyali. – Babuubolɛ ngɔnɛ: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />«Bolaki, Mose atoheneyaki bobeko bɔnɛ: “Kaki loondo looyali la waali aowa, mpe nde la waali tababota, bohibotonga okinde akɔhɔkɔ waali uuko itina iiki abotele bowei bana.” <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Lendaka, eyalaki la bahibotonga nsambo. Ɔnɛ o lontondo abalaki mpe awaki nko bota. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Ɔnɛ o bape abalɛ buunto ɔkɔ, awɛ, tababota. La ɔnɛ o bahato nko ngauko, <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />tii ibɔ bayaankuma nsambo babalɛ waali uuko mpe bawɛ nko bota bana. Mbusa eekibɔ bankuma, buunto ɔkɔ mpe awɛ la nde. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Nde buuna bonga banto bakundwe, anɛ enga ibɔ mpe bakundwe, buunto uuko angooyala waali ɔki nnɔ, itina ibɔ bankuma nsambo babobalaki!» <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yesu abaunoyelɛ: «Luunguhana ngauko itina lopwebe la Nkɔti la nguya eki Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Anɛ enga banto bakundwe nde baawɛ, beele la bainto tabangoyabala, bangooyala nga bentomwa nde lobola. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Nde iilenda nkundwa eeki baawɛ, talotangi nde buku eki Mose nde bonkanda bɔnɛ botepela iholo i ibundja inɛ ipɛtɛ nko longola? Totanga mpiko Ndjakomba abela Mose: “Ndjali Ndjakomba eeki Abalayama, Ndjakomba eeki Izaka mpe Ndjakomba eeki Yakobo.” <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Wambɔ Ndjakomba ayali Ndjakomba eeki banto baabika, tayali Ndjakomba eeki baawɛ. Loyali nde ibunga.»<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bobeko boopenda bɔnɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mat 22, 34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10, 25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Ɔmɔɔ oki balaki ba bobeko abaokaki babɛkɛtɛnɛ. Aɛnɛki Yesu abutolaki ba Saduseyo bɔlɔti; ayaudjɛ ntute la nde mpe abuubolɛ: «Bobeko bo lontondo nde bebeko benkuma nɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yesu abounoyɛ: «Lendaka bobeko boo lontondo: “Isalaɛlɛ, oka! Nkolo Ndjakomba eekinso, ayali Nkolo nko nde kiika. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Olangaka Nkolo Ndjakomba ekiɛ la botema bɔmɔɔ, la bolimo bonkuma, la lyanya inkuma mpe la nguya ekiɛ enkuma.” <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Lenda bobeko bɔnɛ boboyela: “Olangaka boninga okiɛ nga boyalangaka wɛ kiika.” Nko bobeko bonkina bopenda biiko bepee.» <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Bolaki bo bobeko abobelɛ: «Bɔlɔti, Bolaki! Ongotepelɛ nhɔhɔlɔ: Nkolo ayali Ndjakomba nko nde kiika, mpe teyali la Ndjakomba enkina nko nde kiika. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Mpe yobolanga la botema bonkuma, la lyanya inkuma, la nguya enkuma, mpe olange boninga okiɛ ndenge eyalangaka wɛ kiika, iiko iyali la botuya penda bakapo bankuma la mbeka» <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Yesu aɛnɛ angobutolɛ la lyanya; abobelɛ: «Toyali botale la Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba.» Mbuha iiko, nko bonto ɔnɛ o unwaki yoboubola biibo.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masiya la Dawidi</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat 22, 41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20, 41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Aiko elaka Yesu nde tɛmpɛlo, aubolɛ buubo bɔnɛ: «Itina iihangaka balaki ba bobeko mbɔ Masiya ayali bona ooki Dawidi nɔ? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Itina Dawidi nde amongo atepelaki nde ndjela eeki Bolimo bo bɔyɛngwa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“Nkolo abelɛ Nkolo ekimi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Kiha nde lɔbɔ lookimi lo loome,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">tii enga emi nkitye baapokolange enyatelo e bakaka baakiɛ.”<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Kaki Dawidi nde kiika aboeta “Nkolo”: ndenge nnɔ yɔɔhɔ Masiya yoyala lenkina bona ooki Dawidi?»</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 12:37">Bihɛlɛlo bi bobe biiki balaki ba bobeko</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat 23, 1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20, 45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Banto bankuma baokaki Yesu la ibulwako. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Lenda iilakaki nde banto: «Loyalaka la nkɛpɔ la balaki ba bobeko! Ibɔ balangake bakɛnde la benkoto be ntale; balangake banto bababekole nde bihoke; <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />balangake bakihe nde bikili bi ntondo nde betumba be lɔbɔndɔ la nde nonge i lokumo nde ntɛkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Ibɔ baibake byomba biiki bituka bi bainto mpe bakelake mbɔndɔ i ntale ntale kela banto babahime. Bangoobata etumbo eekibɔ mpe engoyala e bɔnɛnɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikapo iipaki etuka e buunto e bɔmbɔlɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21, 1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Yesu akihɛ ntute la itonga i bakapo nde tɛmpɛlo mpe alenda botindo bootika banto bɔhɔlɔ. Bekulaka buuke bapaaki bɛhɔlɔ buuke. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Etuka ɛmɔɔ e buuntɔ e bɔmbɔlɔ ayɛ mpe atikɛ mpata ipe, iyali la botuya bɔkɛ mpendja. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Ɛkɔiko, Yesu abelɛ bakɛndi la nde: «Ndohangela nte nhɔhɔlɔ: etuka iiko e buunto e bɔmbɔlɔ angopɛ penda bankuma baambotike bakapo nde itonga. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Itina baiko bankuma bambɔɔkɔhe nde bɔhɔlɔ bo liko bopa ibɔ la itina, bootika nde itonga; endaka buunto uuko o etuka opa la ibati angotikɛ bɔhɔlɔ bonkuma bombooyale laa nde itina iiki yobikela.»<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu aebyɛ ndenge enga tɛmpɛlo epitane</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat 24, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21, 5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Aiko yoyole Yesu nde tɛmpɛlo, ɔmɔɔ oki bakɛndi la nde abobelɛ: «Bolaki, lenda betindo be babɔkɔ banɛ, lenda betindo be betumba biiko!» <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yesu abobelɛ: «Wɛnɛ betumba biiko be bɛnɛnɛ? Tengotikala nkola la ibɔkɔ imɔɔ nde liko iiki inkina: binkuma bingobukutana.»<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakambo ba lyale la bɛnyɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mat 24, 3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21, 7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yesu akihaki nde ngomba e Ba olive ndjɛlɛlɛ la tɛmpɛlo. Petelo, Yakɛ, Yowane la Andele bayalaki nko ibɔ la nde, babuubolɛ: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />«Otohangele, bakambo bakɔ bangookelama lainga, mpe elembetelo engoolakya mbɔ balanga bakelame nnɔ.»<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Loyalaka la nkɛpɔ mpe la bonto ɔmɔɔ taloundjoyake. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Itina banto buuke bangoya nde lina iikimi mpe bangohanga: “Masiya emi nde ɔnɛ!” Mpe bangoyuundjoya banto buuke. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Anɛ enga looke nsango i bitumba mpe biimiimi be bitumba, talookake bɔɔmɔ; iiko inkuma yɛɛli ikelame, yaa tengoyala laino nsuki e bokili. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Bokundi bɔnɛ bongomuna la bokundi boni, bonkumu bɔnɛ bangoomuna la bonkumu boni; babu bangoobilima la nguya nde ndye buuke mpe ndjala ingoyala. Bakambo baiko bangoyala nga ibangako i lyale i ilamatwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Nga la nyo, loyalaka la nkɛpɔ nyo bamɛlɛ. Bangolotomba nde bihambelo mpe bangolokula bebambo nde betumba be lɔbɔndɔ. Longosamba ntondo eeki bɛndɛlɛ mboka la nkumu itina iiki emi, engolopa mpe epohe yotatola itina ikimi. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Itina etindama ntondo nko Nsango e Bɔlɔti elakeme eka banto bankuma. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Anɛ enga balobute itina iki balotombe nde bihambelo, taloyatungyake la yeeba inga nyo lotepele, yaa lotepelaka nko ingooyola nde elaka iiko, itina tainguma eka nyo, ingoyuma eka Bolimo bo Bɔyɛngwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Bohibotonga angokapa bohibotonga ookinde tii nde iwa, ihe angokela bona nko ngauko ko bana bangoyemalela baboti baakibɔ mpe bangobalyaka. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Banto bankuma bangolotona itina iki lina iiki emi. Yaa boonto ongoyutela tii nde nsuki, angobika.»<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lyale i bɔnɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mat 24, 15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21, 20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />«Anɛ enga lwɛne ɔnɛ weta ibɔ “bobe boopenda”: booya yoyakihya ndye ɛɛpwɛli bɔkɔ la yoyala – bonto ootanga atingolaka! – aiko, banɛ bangoyala Yudeya, balotaka nde ngomba; <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />bonto oongoyala nde mbalahani ɛnɛ liko e botumbo tahulwake yota yɔkɔhɔ yomba nde botumba; <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />mpe bonto oongoyala nde ngonda, taunwake nde botumba itɔkɔhɔ ehenda ekinde. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Biina biiko, engoyala ihɛi itina iki bainto bangooyala la baemi la banɛ bangɔlɔmya! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Lɔbɔndɛlɛ Ndjakomba kela bakambo baiko tabakelamake nde eleko e mpyɔ! <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Itina , lyale iingoyala biina biiko, iipa taikelami ima bobangɛ Ndjakomba yokela bokili, tii lɔlɔkɔ, lyale i ngauko taingoyala lenkina. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Nkolo tapokutole biina biiko, nko bonto oopobika. Yaa itina iiki banɛ bahɔlɛ nde, akutolɛ biina bɛkɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Kaki bonto aolobela: “Lolenda, Masiya ayali anɛ!” laa mpe: “Lolenda, ayali mpeni!”, taloboumeyake. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Itina la Masiya i beyanga la ntepeli i beyanga bangoyoola, bangokela mpapo la bihumwa kela baundjoye la banɛ bahɔlɔmɛ, nga yɔhɔ yokelama. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Nga la nyo, lɔyalaka la nkɛpɔ! Ngolobopolɛ inkuma botako.»<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eyeelo eeki Bona ooki Bonto</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mat 24, 29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21, 25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />«Yaa nde biina biiko, mbuha e lyale iiko, waane bongoyuula, wɛɛli tabongoongala, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />baɔti bangɔkɔ ima nde liko mpe nguya iiyali nde lobola ingonyonga. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Nkamba, bangɔyɛnɛ Bona ooki Bonto aohulwe nde batute la nguya enkuma mpe la nkɛmbɔ. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Angotinda bentomwa beekinde mpe angohangania baahɔlɛ nde bakono bankuma banɛi, ima nde nsuki e nse tii nde nsuki e liko.»<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Balako itina iiki bote bo figi</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mat 24, 32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21, 29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />«Lotingola lwɛlya lɔnɛ loki bote bo figi: Aiko eyali etape boyoyo mpe yoolya nkaha, lwebake nyo kiika nko la baiho mbɔ eleko e bohenge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bohenge boyali nga eleko eebotaka nkaha nde Lokonda </char></note> bɔyɛ ntute. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />La nyo mpe nko ngauko, mbɔkɔ lɔhwɛnɛ bakambo baiko baokelama, aiko looyebaka wambɔ Bona ooki Bonto ayɛ ntute, ntondo i bikuke biikinyo. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Ndohangela nte nhɔhɔlɔ mpendja: ekeke ɛnɛ tengoleka bakambo baiko bankuma nkokelama. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Liko la nse ingoleka, baoy baatepela emi tabangoleka.»<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nko Ndjakomba ɔnɛ weba nsuki</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mat 24, 36-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />«Nde iilenda buuna la ngonga, bonto la ɔmɔɔ apwebe, eyale bentomwa be liko, eyale la Bona; nko Ihe nde amɛlɛ ɔnɛ weba. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Loyalaka la nkɛpɔ, talolalake, itina lopwebe buuna bongoya elaka iiko. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Engoyala nko nga bonto ɔmɔɔ ooli lɔkɛndɔ: ahenyɛ botumba bokinde mpe apɛ bahali baakinde bonkondi booki bɔkɔ, aɛniɛ bonto la bonto bohala bokinde mpe abelɛ bɔhɛndjɛli talaalake. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Talolalake, itina lopwebe elaka engoya bomongo botumba: laa la ikɔlɔ, laa la ngina e botyo, laa la belonge, laa la nkɛhɛ. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Kaki ahoola hohomo, taolotana lolaali. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Bakambo baiko balobela emi aiko, mbela mpe banto bankuma bakɔ: Talolalake!»<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Waango kela balyake Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22, 1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yow 11, 45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Etikalaki biina bepe kela eyenga e Pasika la e mampa iipa la bote ekite. Nkanga i benkondi la balaki ba bobeko batilɛ ndenge babute Yesu la lyanya i bobe mpe baboliyake. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Bayahangelɛ: «Tatokelake lobo lɔkɔ buuna bo ntɛkɔ, itina banto tabaoyolya boyongo.»<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buunto ɔmɔɔ autumolɛ Yesu balahi nde bɔtɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26, 6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yow 12, 1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yesu ayalaki Betani, nde botumba booki Simo, ɔnɛ oyalaki la behale; aiko ɛlɛ nde, Buunto ɔmɔɔ aɔtwɛ aiko la bolangi bo alabatɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">alabatɛ eyali balahi ba mpimbo</char></note> boyoli la balahi ba mpimbo mpe ba botuya. Abolɛ bolangi mpe autumolɛ balahi baiko nde bɔtɛ booki Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Bamɔɔ baki ibɔ baɛnɛki bobe mpe bahangaki: «Itina nɔ iyopita balahi ngauko? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Tɔpɔɔtɛkɛ balahi baiko la bɔhɔlɔ buuke bopenda benkama behato mpe tokapela bɛmbɔlɔ!» Mpe bapɔndɔlɛ buunto uuko mpendja. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Mpe Yesu atepelɛ: «Lobohena. Itina iibotungya nyo nɔ? Angokokyɛ lobo lo bɔlɔti itina iki emi. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Itina biina benkuma loyali nyo la bɛmbɔlɔ, mbala inkuma inga nyo lolange, lɔɔhɔ yobakelela bɔlɔti, yaa emi tatongoyala emi la nyo biina benkuma. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Buunto ɔnɛ angokelɛ imba nde aɔhe: la ngauko, angobangɛ botako yuutumola byonge biiki emi balahi baahingaka ibɔ bonto ntondo eeki babokunde. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Ndohangela nhɔhɔlɔ: ndye inkuma inga Nsango e Bɔlɔti elakeme nde bokili bonkuma, bangotepelakɛ inɛ inga buunto ɔnɛ akelɛ mpe bangoboendjelakɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudasi alanga atɛke Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mat 26, 14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22, 3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Yudasi Isikaliɔtɛ, ɔmɔɔ oki bakɛndi lyomu la bape, atɛ eka Nkanga i benkondi itina iiki yɔtɛkɛ Yesu eka ibɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Anɛ eokɛ ibɔ ngauko, bayalɛ la ibulwako mpe babolakoyɛ bɔhɔlɔ. Mpe Yudasi Isikaliɔtɛ atilɛ ndenge yokapa Yesu nde bɛbɔ beeki ibɔ.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu alɛ elambo e Pasika nde la bakɛndi la nde</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mat 26, 17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22, 7-14</ref>. <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yow 13, 21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Buuna bo lontondo bo ntɛkɔ e mampa iipa la bote, buuna bɔnɛ bolyakaka ibɔ mpata itina i Pasika, bakɛndi la Yesu babuubolɛ: «Olanga totu itɔkɔɔhɔyɔ elambo e Pasika nko?» <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Yesu atindɛ bakɛndi la nde bape, mpe ababelɛ: «Lɔkɛndɛ nde imonga; lokoponana la bonto ɔmɔɔ angobilɛ ibuka i bahi, loboyelaka, <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />mpe eka nde atwa, lobelaka bɔmɛlɛ botumba: “Bolaki aubola: empulu e botumba eeki emi eka emi ndɛ elambo e Pasika emi la bakɛndi la emi eyali nko?” <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Mpe akoolwɛnia empulu e bɔnɛnɛ nde liko ɛbɔngyɛ ibɔ, eyali la binkuma: eyali mpiko enga nyo lɔtɔhɔye itina i elambo.» <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Bakɛndi la nde balangwɛ mpe batɛ nde imonga ikɔ; batanɛ inkuma nko nga bobabelaki Yesu, mpe babɔngyɛ elambo e Pasika.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Anɛ ekitɛ ikɔlɔ, Yesu ayɛ nde la bakɛndi la nde lyomu la bape. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Aiko ekihi ibɔ mpe ɛlɛ ibɔ nde mesa, Yesu ahangɛ: «Ndohangela nhɔhɔlɔ: ɔmɔɔ okinyo ɔlɛ la emi angɔtɛkɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Bakɛndi la nde baokɛ bobe, mpe babuubolɛ ɔmɔɔ la ɔmɔɔ: «Eyali emi?» <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yesu abaunoyelɛ: «Eyali la ɔmɔɔ okinyo nde lyomu la bape ɔlɛ la emi saani ɛmɔɔ. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Bona oki Bonto aoli iwa nko ndenge eetepela Nkɔti itina iikinde; ihɛi la bonto onga Bona ooki Bonto akapeme itina ikinde! Ɛbɔngɔki bonto uuko tabotwake la mbotwa nde bokili!»<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elambo</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mat 26, 26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22, 14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11, 23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Aiko ebanga ibɔ yɔlɛ, Yesu akɔhɛ mampa; lombuha lo yɔtɔmɛya bekako, apupolɛ ɛkɔ, mpe apɛ bakɛndi la nde, ababelɛ: «Loma, ɔnɛ eyali byonge biikimi.» <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Mpe akɔhɛ mbongo e vino, atotyɛ Ndjakomba, abapɛ ɛkɔ, mpe bamɛlɛ ibɔ bankuma. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Ɔnɛ eyali bakila bakimi, bakila ba Boheka booki Ndjakomba, bangutumwɛ itina iki banto buuke. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Ndobela nte nhɔhɔlɔ, ntingounwa lenkina yɔmɛlɛ vino, tii buuna bonga emi mɛle vino e ntɛmu nde Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba.» <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Anɛ eheyɛ ibɔ yeemba nyembo, balangwɛ yota nde ngomba e ba Olive.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aebyɛ mbɔ Petelo angoboangana</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26, 31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22, 31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yow 13, 36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Nyo bankuma lɔngɔkɔ, itina ɛkɔtɔmɛ mbɔ: “Ngokula bɔbɔkɔli, mpe mpata ingotyangwa.” <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Nga nsookundwa, ngɔlɔndia lontondo lookinyo Ngalilaya.» <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Petelo abobelɛ: «La nga banɛ bankuma bangokolotɛ, emi ntingokohena.» <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Mpe Yesu abobelɛ: «Nkobela nhɔhɔlɔ nko botyo bɔnɛ bo lɔlɔkɔ, ntondo eeki nkɔkɔ ebeke mbala ipe, okoonyangana mbala ihato.» <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Mpe Petelo abobelɛ la nguya: «Ntingokwangana la bona o ema, la nga ɛɛli mbu emi la wɛ.» Mpe ibɔ bankuma batepelɛ nko ngauko.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu abɔndɛlɛ Ngesemani</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat 26, 36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22, 39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Anɛ ekitɛ ibɔ nde ndye ɛnɛ eta ibɔ Ngesemani, Yesu abelɛ bakɛndi la nde: «Lokiha anɛ elaka iiko e oli emi itɔbɔndɛlɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Akɔhɛ Petelo la Yakɛ la Yowane. Abangɛ yooka bɔɔmɔ mpe la yoyatungya. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Ababelɛ nde ambɔ: «Botema bokimi boyɛ la ihɛi i ntombi nde iwa; lotikala anɛ mpe lwɛtɛtɛlɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Atɛ bona o botale, ayahuloyɛ nde babu mpe abɔndɛlɛ itina iiki, nga ɛbɔngɔ, elaka iiko eume ntute la nde. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Yesu atepelɛ: «Aba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14, 36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aba eyeli lina i iiki Banto ba Alami ilakania lina iikii ihe eebota bonto ootepela laa ɔnɛ otepela ibɔ iitina iikinde.</char></note>, Ihe eekimi, ɔɔhɔ yokela mbo inkuma, umola mbongo ɛnɛ e lyale ntute la emi! Endaka, teyalake nga bolanga emi, yaa nga bolanga wɛ.» <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Mpe Yesu aunwelɛ bakɛndi la nde, abatanɛ balaali, abelɛ Petelo: «Simo, olaali! Tuuha ywɛtɛtɛlɛ nkya ngonga ɛmɔɔ! <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Lwɛtɛtɛlɛ mpe lɔbɔndɛlɛ, kela talɔkɔɔke nde lomeko. Bolimo boyali la nguya, yaa byonge biyali bɔɔlu.»<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Yesu atɛ lenkina bona o botale mpe abɔndɛlɛ lenkina nko ndenge ɛbɔndɛlɛki nde. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Yesu ayɛ lenkina eka bakɛndi la nde mpe abatanɛ lenkina balaali; bayalaki la ilɔ nde baiho. Mpe tabaeba la lobo lo yobobela. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Aunwɛ mbala ɛnɛ e ehato, ababelɛ: «Lolaali nko ndaala? luutya! Anɛ mbo yoohila. Elaka yooyela! Aiko eekeko, Bona ooki Bonto angokapemɛ nde bɛbɔ beeki banto ba bahumu. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Lwemala, tɔkɛnde! Lenda, bonto ɔnɛ ɔntɛkɛ angoyɛ.»<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbutama eeki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26, 47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22, 47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yow 18, 3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Mpe nko aiko etepela Yesu, Yudasi, ɔmɔɔ oki bakɛndi lyomu la bape, ayɛ nde la banto buuke babuti babaka la bɛmbɔndu. Nkanga i benkondi la balaki ba bobeko la bingambi babatindaki. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yudasi, ɔnɛ obatɛkɛlɛki Yesu, abapaki elembetelo ɛnɛ: «Bonto uuko opotamelɛ emi, eyali nde. Lobobutaka, lobotombaka mpe lɔbɔhɛndjɛlɛkɛ bɔlɔti.» <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Anɛ ekitaki Yudasi, ayaundjɛ ntute la Yesu mpe abobelɛ: «Bolaki!» Mpe abopotamelɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />La mbala ɛmɔɔ, banto baayaki bakandɛ Yesu, mpe babobutɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Nde baiko bayalaki aiko, ɔmɔɔ oki ibɔ aolyɛ ibaka, akɔtɛ bohali booki Nkanga e bonkondi mpe abopupolɛ itoi. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yesu ababelɛ: «Nsookita bonto boyongo kela loye yombuta la babaka la bɛmbɔndu? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Mboyalakɛ emi la nyo biina benkuma mpe mboolakakɛ nde tɛmpɛlo, talombuta. Yaa inɛ yookelama kela Nkɔti ikokyame.» <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Bakɛndi la nde babolotɛ mpe bayabɛlɛ lobango. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Bolangala bɔmɔɔ ayeelaki Yesu, alɔtɔki nko imputa. Balangɛ babobute la nde, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />yaa nde ahenɛ imputa mpe alotɛ nko bo mpo nko bo mpɛkɛhɛni.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu nde ehambelo e bɔnɛnɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mat 26, 57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22, 54-55</ref>. <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yow 18, 13-14</ref>. <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Batɛ la Yesu eka Nkanga e bonkondi, ndye ehokamaki Nkanga i benkondi inkuma la bingambi la balaki ba bobeko. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Petelo ayeelaki Yesu la botale mpe aɔtwɛ nde inkana iki Nkanga e bonkondi. Akihɛ ndye ɛmɔɔ nde la bahɛndjɛli, mpe aɔkɛ ntyɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Nkanga i benkondi la banto bankuma ba ehambelo batilɛ itatoli inɛ ipa ibɔ Yesu ɛkwa kela babopaa etumbo e iwa, yaa tababata. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Banto buuke baolaki la mbo yobolimbela, yaa imba batepelakɛ itikwanaki. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Bamɔɔ bayɛ kela babolimbele ikambo mbɔ: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />«Tobookaki atepela: “Ngɔkɔyɔ tɛmpɛlo ɛnɛ etongaki banto, mpe nko la bɛkɔlɔ behato ngotonga enkina epa tengokelama la banto.”» <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Yaa nkya ngauko, iitepelaki ibɔ itikwanaki. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Nkanga e bonkondi aemalɛ ntondo e banto, aubolɛ Yesu: «Opala mbuto nde iiko inkuma ikopunda ibɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Yaa Yesu apilamaki, tapaa la mbuto ɛmɔɔ. Nkanga e bonkondi abuubolɛ lenkina: «Oyali Masiya, Bona ooki Ndjakomba etwakwamɛ?» <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yesu aunoyɛ: «Ɔɔ, ndjali Masiya, mpe lɔngɔyɛnɛ Bona ooki Bonto akihi nde lɔbɔ lo loome looki Ndjakomba ɛnɛ nguya; lɔngɔbɔɛnɛ mpe aoye nde batute ba liko.» <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Nkanga e bonkondi aatolɛ bihenda biikinde mpe ahangɛ: «Topooyali lenkina la itina la nyɛnɛki! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Longookɛ ndenge enga nde atukɛ Ndjakomba. Lokanena nɔ?» Mpe ibɔ bankuma ibɔ ambɔ: angɔkɔ ikambo mpe aɛli la iwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Banto bankina babɔtwɛ nhɔi, babolipɛ elongi, babokulɛ mpakata mpe bahangɛ: «Ebaka bonto oombookokule!» Mpe bahɛndjɛli bakɔhɛ Yesu, baboatɛ ntaka.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petelo aanganɛ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat 26, 69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22, 56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yow 18, 15-18</ref>. <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Aiko eyalaki Petelo nde inkana, bosali bɔmɔɔ bo buunto boki Nkanga e bonkondi ayɛ. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Aɛnɛ Petelo aɔkɔ ntyɛ, abohihimyɛ mpe abobelɛ: «La wɛ oyalaki wɛ la Yesu, bonto uuko o Nazalɛti.» <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Petelo aanganɛ nde ambɔ: «Mpwebe mpe mpotingole iiko ilanga wɛ otepele.» Nde ɔnɛ oolɛ mpe atɛ nde yɔtwɛlo i botumba. [Mpe nkɔkɔ ebekɛ.] <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Yaa bosali buuko bo buunto abɔɛnɛ mpe abelɛ banto baayalaki aiko: «Bonto uuko ayali ɔmɔɔ oki ibɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Petelo aanganɛ lenkina. Baiko bayalaki aiko babelɛ Petelo lenkina: «Eyali nko nhɔhɔlɔ, oyali bonto ookibɔ, itina la wɛ mpe oyali bonto o Ngalilaya.» <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Petelo ahimbɛ bohai la bitio: «Mpwebe bonto uuko ombela nyo.» <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Nko nde elaka iiko, nkɔkɔ ebekɛ mbala e bape, mpe Petelo abopwɛ inɛ ibobelaki Yesu: «Ntondo eeki nkɔkɔ ebeke, ongonyangana mbala ihato.» Alelɛ.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu ntondo eki Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27, 1-2</ref>. <ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23, 1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yow 18, 28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Nko nkɛhɛ ɛkia, Nkanga i benkondi bahokamɛ ibɔ la bingambi la balaki ba bobeko mpe banto bankuma ba ehambelo e bɔnɛnɛ. Batungyɛ Yesu nkɔli, babotombɛ mpe babokapaki eka Pilato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato aubolɛ Yesu: «Oyali nkumu eeki Bayuda?» Yesu abounoyelɛ: «Eyali wɛ ootepela.» <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Nkanga i benkondi babolobɛ la mbo buuke. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilato abuubolɛ lenkina: «Opopa mbuto? Opooke iiko inkuma ikoloba ibɔ!» <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Yesu tapa la mbuto ɛmɔɔ, mpe Pilato akulaki nko bakoto.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bapɛ Yesu etumbo e iwa</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mat 27, 15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23, 13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yow 18, 39-19, 16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Nde ntɛkɔ inkuma, Pilato ambooyolyakɛ bonto ɔmɔɔ oyali nde bɔlɔkɔ onga banto baotyɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Elaka iiko, bonto ɔmɔɔ o lina Balanabasi, ayalaki nde bɔlɔkɔ nde la banto bankina ba boyongo mpe balyakaki bonto. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Banto buuke batɛ mpe baotyɛ Pilato abakelele bakambo baekehelɛ nde yobakelela mbala la mbala. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato abaunoyelɛ: «Lolanga ndooleye nkumu eeki Bayuda?» <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Aebaki bɔlɔti mbɔ Nkanga i benkondi bakapaki Yesu nde bɛbɔ beeki nde la inkunya. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Yaa Nkanga i benkondi batindaki banto buuke baotye babaoleye Balanabasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilato aunwɛ lenkina yuubola banto: «Lolanga mpendja nkele la bonto ɔnɛ weta nyo nkumu eeki Bayuda nɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Babobɛ lenkina la nguya: «Baka nde nde ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato abaubolɛ mbala enkina: «Ikambo nte i bobe ikelɛ nde nnɔ?» Yaa ibɔ bapendɛ lenkina yoboba la nguya: «Baka nde nde ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Nga bolangaki Pilato aokye banto bɔlɔti, abaoleyɛ Balanabasi; akulɛ Yesu bebambo mpe abohenɛ babobake nde ekulusu.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bahola baɔlɛ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mat 27, 27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yow 19, 2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Bahola batombɛ Yesu nde ehambelo eeki bɔndɛlɛ mboka, mpe bahokyɛ etuluku enkuma e bahola. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Balɔtyɛ Yesu bonkoto bo ngola la lɔpɔpi lo nhɛndɛ nde bɔtɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Mpe babobekolɛ: «Losako, nkumu eeki Bayuda!» <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Babokulaki bontuma bɔmɔɔ nde bɔtɛ, babɔtwaki nhɔi mpe bakɔɔki bakulubɔngɔ yayahunia ntondo eekinde. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Anɛ eheyɛ ibɔ yɔbɔɔlɔ, babolungolɛ bonkoto bo ngola mpe babɔlɔtyɛ bihenda biikinde. Nkamba baboolyɛ nde bongala kela babobake nde ekulusu.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Babakɛ Yesu nde ekulusu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27, 32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23, 26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yow 19, 17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Bahola babutɛ boleki ndjela bɔmɔɔ boumaki nde ngonda la boolo kela abile ekulusu eeki Yesu, lina iikinde Simo, bohi Silɛnɛ, ihe eeki Alezande la Lifisu. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Batombɛ Yesu nde ndye ɛmɔɔ eetaka ibɔ Ngologota, elimbola wambɔ «ndye e Lɔbɛkɛ». <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Babopɛ baana ba vino bahanganiɛ ibɔ la mile<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mile</char></note>, yaa Yesu talanga amɛle. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Babobakɛ nde ekulusu mpe bakapɛ bihenda biikinde, la yolika bɛbɛlɛ kela baebe enga bonto la bonto abatɛ. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Anɛ ekitɛ ngonga e ibwa e nkɛhɛ, babobakɛ nde ekulusu. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Nde ibaya inɛ yeebyaki ibɔ itina i ikambo iibopaki ibɔ etumbo, bakɔtɔki ngɔnɛ: «Nkumu eeki Bayuda». <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Babakɛ Yesu nde ekulusu bɔlɔngɔ la banto bape ba boyongo, ɔmɔɔ nde lɔbɔ lo loome, ɔmɔɔ nde lɔbɔ lo lwali.[ <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Eyali nko botindo buuko bɔɛli Nkɔti ikokyama: «Babotangaki nde bɔlɔngɔ booki banto ba boyongo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15, 28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lenda nde Isa 53, 12; Luk 22, 37.</char></note>.» ]<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Baleki ndjela babotoolɛ la yonyongya bɛtɛ; bahangɛ: «Ee! wɛ ɔnɛ ɔkɔyɔ tɛmpɛlo mpe otonga ɛkɔ lenkina la biina besato, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />yabikya wɛ amɛlɛ mpe hulwa nde ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />La Nkanga i benkondi la balaki ba bobeko mpe baɔlɛ Yesu mpe bayabelɛ ibɔ kiika: «Abikyaki banto bankina, yaa apɔɔhe yoyabikya nde kiika! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Kilito, nkumu eeki Isalaɛlɛ hulwaka aiko ekeeko nde ekulusu kela twɛne mpe toumeye.» La banɛ babakemaki la Yesu nde ekulusu babotoolaki la ibɔ.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iwa iiki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27, 45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23, 44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yow 19, 28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Ima midi tii ngonga e ehato e ikɔ, buulima bɔɔtwɛ nde bokili bonkuma. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Mpe la ngonga ɛkɔ e ehato e ikɔlɔ, Yesu abobɛ la nguya: «Eloi, Eloi, lama sabatani?» – elimbola wambɔ «Ndjakomba eeki emi, Ndjakomba eeki emi, itina iinga wɛ onhenɛ nɔ?» – <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Bamɔɔ banto baemalaki aiko, baokɛ aiko eboba nde mpe bahangɛ: «Lwalya, aeta Elia!» <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Ɔmɔɔ atukumwɛ lobango, aniniɛ inyuka nde baana ba bokai, atikɛ ikɔ nde nhɔli e ekalamba, apɛ Yesu amɛle mpe abobelɛ: «Lolila, tolende kaki Elia akooya yobohuleya nde ekulusu!» <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Yaa Yesu abobɛ la nguya mpe akomɛ botema.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Ehenda ɛnɛ ɛlɛlɛmɛkɛ nde tɛmpɛlo eatwɛ bitate bipe ima nde liko tii nde nse. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Bonkondi bo bahola nkama bɔnɛ boemalaki ntondo eeki Yesu, ɛnɛki ndenge eekomaki nde botema, nde ambɔ: «Bonto ɔnɛ ayalaki nte Bona ooki Ndjakomba!» <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Bamɔɔ bainto baemalaki bona o botale, bayaki yolenda. Nde bainto baiko, eyalaki Balia ba Bangandala, Balia, nyango eeki Yakɛ ɛnɛ eboha la Yose ko la Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Bambooboyelakɛ mpe bamboobolambelakɛ anɛ eyalaki nde Ngalilaya. Bainto bankina ebele baataki ibɔ la Yesu Yelusalɛmɛ la ibɔ bayalaki aiko.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakundɛ Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27, 57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23, 50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yow 19, 38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42-43" />Anɛ ekitɛ ikɔlɔ, nde boloy bo ba baome ba bihe baaki Bayuda, eyalaki la bonto ɔmɔɔ, lina ikinde Yosepu, bohi Alimateyo. Yosepu ayalaki ɔmɔɔ oki ehambelo omangaka ibɔ la nde mpe amboolilakɛ eyeelo eeki Bonkumu booki Ndjakomba. Eyalaki buuna bo yaɔhɔlɔ, wambɔ mputu e sabata. Ɛkɔiko, Yosepu atɛ la lokaho eka Pilato mpe abuubolɛ ebembe eeki Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:42-43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilato akulɛ bakoto aiko e okɛ nde mbɔ Yesu angohilɛ yowa. Aetɛ bonkondi bo bahola mpe abuubolɛ kaki Yesu angowɛ kala. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Anɛ e okɛ nde mbuto eeki bonkondi bo bahola mbɔ eyali nko ngauko, apɛ Yosepu ndjela akɔhe ebembe eeki Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yosepu asombɛ bombuli, ahuloyɛ ebembe nde ekulusu, akelingɛ nde bombuli buuko mpe aketikɛ nde ipoku iitondolaki ibɔ nde ibɔkɔ. Alipɛ ibɔkɔ i bɔnɛnɛ yolipa buuho bo ipoku <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Balia ba bangandala la Balia, nyango eeki Yose balendaki ndye eetika ibɔ ebembe eeki Yesu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Nkundwa eeki Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28, 1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24, 1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yow 20, 1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Anɛ ehilɛ buuna bo sabata, Balia ba Bangandala, Balia nyango eki Yakɛ la Salome bahombɛ balahi kela batu itokotya byonge biiki Yesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />La elonge e nkɛhɛ, nde buuna bo ntondo booki pɔsɔ, batɛ nde ngelo. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Bayaubolɛ ibɔ kiika: «Okootumoya ibɔkɔ iki iyali nde buuho bo ipoku nɔ?» <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Mpe anɛ euleyɛ ibɔ baiho, baɛnɛ ɛbɔkɔbɔkɔ iko ingumɛ. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Anɛ yɔtwɛ ibɔ nde ipoku; baɛnɛ mpiko bolangala bɔmɔɔ bo loondo akihi nde lɔbɔ lo loome, alɔti bonkoto bo mpɛmbɛ mpe baokɛ bɔɔmɔ. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Eboha e loondo iko ababelɛ: «Lwambya yooka bɔɔmɔ; lotila Yesu e Nazalɛti, ɛnɛ ebakaki ibɔ nde ekulusu; angokundwɛ, tayali anɛ. Lolenda ndye ebolalyaki ibɔ. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Lɔkɛndɛ nko aiko ekeeko itohangela bakɛndi la nde la Petelo: “angɔlɔndyɛ Ngalilaya: mpiko enga nyo lobotane, nga bolohangelaki nde.”» <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Baolɛ mpe baumɛ lobango ntute la ipoku itina ibɔ bankuma bayalaki la bɔɔmɔ mpe lyanya ibahilaki. Tabahangela la bonto ɔmɔɔ itina bayalaki la bɔɔmɔ.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 16:8">Yesu ayaɛniɛ eka Balia ba Bangandala</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 16:8">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28, 9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Yow 20, 11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Anɛ ekundwɛ Yesu la nkɛhɛ eki buuna bo ntondo booki pɔsɔ, aolelaki ntondo Balia ba Bangandala, ɔnɛ oumolaki nde belimo be bobe nsambo. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Balia ba Bangandala atɛ otohangela banɛ bayalaki la nde. Bayalaki la ihɛi mpe balela. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Yaa anɛ yokaki ibɔ ahanga: «Yesu ayali la bɔmɔi, mbɔbɔɛne!», tababoumeya.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ayɛniɛ eka bakɛndi la nde bape</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luk 24, 13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Nko nde mbuha iko, Yesu ayaɛniɛ botindo bonkina eka bankɛndi la nde bape bayalaki nde ndjela batunwa ndja. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Baunwaki mpe bahangelaki baninga banɛ bamɔɔ, ibɔ tabaumeya.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aolelɛ bakɛndi lyomu la ɔmɔɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28, 16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24, 36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yow 20, 19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Bes 1, 6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Mbuha iiko, Yesu aolelɛ bakɛndi lyomu la ɛmɔɔ nko balɛ; abapɛlɛ itina tabayali la waambi mpe bakangaki botema tabaumeyake banto banɛ babɔɛnɛki lombuha lo nkundwa. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Mpe ababelɛ: «Lɔkɛndɛ nde bokili bonkuma itoebya Nsango e Bɔlɔti eka banto bankuma. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Bonto ongoyaamba mpe ongoyuunama angobika; yaa opa tangwamba, angokita nde ikambo. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Lolenda bilembetelo bingoyala la banto baangoyamba: bangoyolya belimo be bobe nde lina iiki emi; bangotepela benya be ntɛmu; <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />kaki bangobutɛ ndjɔ nde bɛbɔ mpe bangɔmɛlɛ nkya ngɛngɛ ɛɛkɔ, tengobakela bobe; bangoyapya banto ba nkandi bɛbɔ mpe bangobika.»<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu aunwɛ eka Ndjakomba</para>
  <para style="r">(Lenda la nde <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luk 24, 50-53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Bes 1, 9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Anɛ eheyɛ Nkolo Yesu yotepela ngauko, auleyamɛ nde liko mpe akihɛ nde lɔbɔ lo loome looki Ndjakomba. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Bakɛndi la nde batɛ itoebyaka Nsango e Bɔlɔti. Nkolo ayalaki la ibɔ mpe ambokokyakɛ Lyoi iiki Ndjakomba nde bilembetelo bi mpapo imbabakelakɛ.<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>